<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kumbukumbu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Kumbukumbu da Malagizo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kumbukumbu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kumb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha tano cha Musa kikemigwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kumbukumbu da Malagizo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Kumbukumbu da Malagizo chobwelela malagizo galavigwe mna ivitabu viyagwe va malagizo. Yogesigwa kamba Musa ayo yandike kitabu kino ila ikifungu cha kimambukizo kiiyeka kilonga mbuli ya ifa yake, acho handike heyo bule. Kitabu kino chosonga kwa mbuli kamba mbuli zino azo Musa ziyawalongele Waizilaeli. Mbuli ya kamba Musa ayo kandika kitabu kino yokoneka mna idilagano da sambi. Mfano umoja okoneka mkitabu cha Sang'hano za Iwatumigwa 3:22-23 hanhu aho Petulo kotambula Kumbukumbu da Malagizo 18:15-18 na kolonga kamba zino zikala mbuli za Musa. Yogesigwa Musa kandika kitabu cha Kumbukumbu da Malagizo na ivitabu viyagwe va Mwanduso na Kulawa na Mbuli za Walawi na Kupetigwa muumwaka kamba wa 1300 hebu 1400, Kilisito yang'hali Kuvumbuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Kumbukumbu da Malagizo chandikigwa kamba kinhu cha kuilagana kwa mndewa na undewa uyagwe uli hasi ya utawala wake, kamba viitendigwe ako umwaka. Gano malagano ga Imulungu na iwanhu wa Izilaeli. Imulungu katogola kuwatenda iwanhu wamwede kamba wahatogola kugoga malagizo gake. Kamba Waizilaeli wahagalema malagizo ga Imulungu, avo okobozwa. Zino azo mbuli ng'hulu mkitabu kino, lakini sula ya 27 na sula ya 28 zogangamiza kamba mbuli ino ya ukweli kwa kulonga ukumweda na gamakungu mbuli ya kugagoga malagizo hebu kugabena kwa iwanhu wa Izilaeli. Makabila gayagwe ga Izilaeli gema kulugongo luno na gayagwe gema kulugongo luno, kuno goilola na wailongela ukumweda ako na gamakungu kamba nzila ya kutogola ago gamalagizo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula 1 mbaka 3 Musa kokumbusila gaja galawilile mna umwanza wa kuloka uluwala.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula 4 mbaka 26 zolonga mbuli ya gaja galongigwe mdilagano mbuli ya Imulungu na iwanhu zake.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho mna isula ya 27 mbaka 30 wanhu wa Izilaeli olonga ukumweda na gamakungu kwa sauti ng'hulu kulagusa kamba kulawa kipindi acho lagano ajo dibitizwa.</para>
  <para style="io">Kukimambukizo, mna isula ya 31 mbaka 34 Musa kolonga mbuli za kimambukizo kwa Yoshua na kwa kila kabila da Izilaeli yang'hali hanakufa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga kusegela Holebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Kitabu kino kina mbuli ziyalongile Musa kwa wanhu wose wa Izilaeli kuko kuluwala mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. Wakala kubonde da Yolidani behi na Sufu, mwambu umoja wa buga da Palani, na mwambu uyagwe wa mabuga ga Tofeli na Labani na Haseloti na Dizahabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Kulawa kulugongo lwa Holebu mbaka Kadeshi Balinea ugenzi wa siku longo na imoja kwa nzila ya kulugongo lwa Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>Siku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa longo na moja, mwaka wa malongo mane, toka Waizilaeli viwasegele Misili, Musa kawalongela wanhu kila kinhu kiyamulagize Mndewa Imulungu yawalongele. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Katenda vivo, kipindi Mndewa Imulungu viyamuhumile mndewa Sihoni wa Heshiboni na mndewa Ogu wa Bashani yakalile mmabuga ga Ashitaloti na Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Ako kuna umwambu uyagwe wa lwanda lwa Yolidani mwiisi ya Moabu, Musa kasonga kuwalongela iwanhu malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu katulongela vino vitukalile ako kulugongo lwa Holebu, kalonga, ‘Mukala kipindi kitali kulugongo luno, <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>sambi tuleni ng'hambi yenu mugendelele na mwanza. Gendeni kuna ivigongo va isi ya Waamoli na isi ili behi ako Alaba, kuvigongo na kubonde ako Negebu na mwhani. Mugende mbaka mwiisi ya Kanaani na isi ya Lebanoni mbaka ako kuna ulwanda mkulu wa Fulate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Isi yose ayo niwagwaa mweye, avo gendeni mukaisole isi ayo, niye Mndewa Imulungu niiduwila kwa wahenga zenu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo na ulelo wao.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kosagula vilongozi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kulawa 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Musa kawalongela iwanhu, “Vitukalile tung'hali ako kulugongo lwa Holebu, niye niwalongela vino, ‘Mweye mwa wengi ng'hani, niye sidaha bule kuwalongoza niiyeka. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawatenda muwe wengi, sambi mwa wengi kamba nhondo za kuulanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zenu, yawengeze miyanza elufu imoja ng'hani kubanza vimwili sambi, na yawatende mumwede kamba viyalongile kotenda. <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Lakini niye niiyeka sidaha bule kuwalongoza na kuwagombeleza mwahagomba. <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Saguleni wanhu kulawa kila kabila, wanhu weli na nzewele na wabala na otegelezigwa ili niwatende wawe vilongozi wenu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>Mweye mutogola na munidika vino, ‘Gago gaulongile ganoga.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Avo niwasola awo ivilongozi weli na nzewele, awo wamuwasagule kulawa mna gamakabila genu, niwatenda wawe vilongozi wenu. Wayagwe niwatenda wawalongoze vibumbila va iwanhu elufu na iwanhu magana na iwanhu malongo matano na iwanhu longo. Vivija niwasagula wayagwe wawe iwakulu wa kila kabila.<verse eid="DEU 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>“Kipindi acho niwagwaa iwasemi wenu malagizo gano, ‘Tegelezeni goya vitala va wanhu wenu. Taguseni goya vitala va wanhu wenu, iwe iwenekae hebu iwanhu baki iwokala hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Sikumumbagule munhu vonda muwataguse iwanhu, wategelezeni bila kuwabagula iwakulu na iwadodo. Sikumumdumbe munhu yoyose, kwavija Imulungu ayo yotagusa. Kitala chochose kidala ngalileni niye na niye nokitegeleza.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Kipindi acho vivija niwalongela gose gomulondigwa kutenda.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu longo na wabili otumigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Kupetigwa 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>“Avo kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu viyatulagize, tusonga mwanza wetu kulawa kulugongo lwa Holebu, tubita ako kuluwala lugela bwembwe, tugoga inzila ichola kuna iisi ya kuvigongo va Waamoli. Vituvikile Kadeshi Balinea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>niye niwalongela, ‘Sambi muvika kuvigongo va isi ya Waamoli, iyotugwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/>Loleni, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawagwaa mweye isi ino. Avo ingileni mukaisole kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zenu viyawalongele. Sikumudumbe hebu kunyawanyawa!’<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>“Abaho mweye mose mwiza kumwangu munongela, ‘Tuleke tutume wanhu wakaisungulile isi ayo abaho wabwele watulongele nzila inogile kubita na mabuga ga kuko vigali.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>Mbuli ayo inogela, avo niwasagula wanhu longo na wabili, munhu imoja kulawa kila kabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>Wanhu awo wasegela, wachola mwiisi ayo ya kuvigongo, wavika kubonde da Eshikoli na wadisungulila. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>Viwabwelile, wapapa matunda ga isi ayo na watulongela isi ayo iyotugwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu inoga.<verse eid="DEU 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>“Lakini mweye hamulondile kugoga lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mulema kuchola mwiisi ayo. <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Muiyalala mvibanda venu mulonga, ‘Mndewa Imulungu katwihila, lekaavo katulava mwiisi ya Misili. Kalonda kutugela mmakono ga Waamoli ili watukome. <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>Avo tuchole kwahi? Ndugu zetu watubena nguvu, watulongela, “Wanhu awo wana nguvu na watali kubanza siye, mabuga gao makulu, wagazungulusila senyenge mbaka kuulanga. Vivija tuyona mizinhu mikulu, awo iwanhu wa ulelo wa Waanaki!” ’<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>“Lakini niye niwalongela vino, ‘Sikumunyawenyawe na sikumuwadumbe wanhu awo. <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, ayo yowalongolela, heyo mwenyego koitowa na hewo mbuli yenu kamba viyatendile kuno molola ako Misili, <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>na kuja kuluwala. Mona Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyawapapile kamba tata viyompapa mwanage, mnzila yose mbaka muvika hanhu hano.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32"/>Hamoja niwalongela vivo, hamumtamanile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33"/>yawalongolele mmwanza wenu, ikilo kwa mhanda ya moto na imisi kwa wingu, kawazahilila hanhu ha kwika ng'hambi na kawalagusila inzila ya kubita.<verse eid="DEU 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>“Mndewa Imulungu viyahulike kuiyalala kwenu, kagevuzika na kaiduwila kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>‘Kuduhu hata munhu imoja kulawa muulelo uno wa iwanhu otenda gehile yonda yengile mwiisi ayo inogile iniiduwile nowagwaa wahenga zenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>ila Kalebu mwanage Yefune yaiyeka ayo yonda yengile, na niye nomgwaa isi ayo iyaikanyage kwa magulu gake, iwe yake na ulelo wake kwavija kanikweleleza niye Mndewa Imulungu kwa moyo wake wose.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu kanigevuzikila niye mbuli yenu mweye, kalonga, ‘Vivija na gweye Musa, honda wingile bule mwiisi ayo. <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Lakini ayo yokutaza, Yoshua mwanage Nuni kokwingila, avo umgele moyo, kwavija heyo ayo yonda yawalongoze wanhu wa Izilaeli waihazi isi ayo.’<verse eid="DEU 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>“Abaho Mndewa Imulungu katulongela siye wose, ‘Awo iwana omulonga osoligwa na iwanhu owehila mweye, awo iwana wenu ving'hele walekile kujuwa ganogile na gehile, okwingila mwiisi ayo. Niye nowagwaa na hewo yokuwa isi yao. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Lakini mweye, hindukeni mubwele kuluwala kubitila nzila ya kuchola bahali ya Shamu.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>“Avo, mweye munidika, ‘Tumtenda nzambi Mndewa Imulungu. Avo, tochola na kuitowa na hewo kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu viyatulagize.’ Avo kila imoja wenu keka mgoha wake mdiega, mwagiza vibuha kuchola kuivamila isi ayo ya kuvigongo. <verse eid="DEU 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Walongele wanhu awo, sikuwachole kuitowa kwavija niye niwaleka, sikuwachole buleavo ohumwa na iwanhu owehila.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>Avo niye niwalongela, lakini hamutegeleze bule na mudilema lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu na kwa kuitapa kwenu mukwela kuvigongo avo. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>Waamoli okala kuvigongo avo wahumuluka wawavamila na kuwaswaswanya kamba nyuki, wawatowa ako Seili mbaka Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Mubwela na mmulilila Mndewa Imulungu, lakini Mndewa Imulungu hawategeleze bule hebu kuwagelegeza. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Avo, musigala ako Kadeshi siku heleketwaa, mukala kuko.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu okwanga kuluwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>“Abaho tuhinduka tufunga mwanza wa kuchola kuluwala kubitila nzila ya bahali ya Shamu, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyanongele. Kwa siku nyingi tung'hali tuzunguluka mnzila kuvigongo va isi ya Seili.<verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>“Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>‘Mwanga hano kuvigongo kwa siku nyingi, avo sambi hindukeni umwambu wa kasikazini. <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>Walagize iwanhu, “Sambi mobitila mwiisi ya kuvigongo va Seili, isi ya ndugu zenu wanhu wa ulelo wa Esau. Hewo owadumba mweye, lakini muiteganye, <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>sikumuitowe na hewo kwavija siwagwaa bule hanhu hohose ha isi yao. Siwagwaa hata hanhu hadodo hakukanyaga lwayo. Isi ayo ya kuvigongo va Seili niwagwaa wanhu wa ulelo wa Esau iwe yao. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Mugule ndiya yonda muje na mazi gonda mung'we.” ’<verse eid="DEU 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawatenda mumwede mna zisang'hano zenu zose za makono genu. Kawalola goya mmwanza wenu wose wa kukiwala kino kikulu. Miyaka yose ayo malongo mane Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kakala hamoja na mweye na hamuswelile kinhu chochose.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>“Avo tugendelela na mwanza wetu tuwabita ndugu zetu, awo iwanhu wa ulelo wa Esau wakalile ako Seili, tuileka nzila ya kubitila Alaba, ilawa Elati na Esioni Gebeli na tubitila nzila ya kuluwala lwa Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Sikumuwagaze wanhu wa Moabu hebu kuwadovula ili muitowe, kwavija siwagwaa bule isi ayo. Niye niwagwaa isi ayo ya Ali iwanhu wa ulelo wa Lutu kamba uhazi wao.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>Umwaka isi ayo ya Ali wakala wanhu wengi ng'hani wakalile na nguvu wakemigwe Waemi na wakala watali kamba Waanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Kamba viweli Waanaki, wanhu awo wakemigwa Walefai, lakini wanhu wa Moabu wawakema Waemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Vivija ako umwaka Waholi wakala okala ako Seili, lakini wanhu wa ulelo wa Esau wawawinga na wawakoma, abaho hewo wakala mwiisi ayo kamba vija wanhu wa Izilaeli viwatendile ako kuna iisi iyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>“Mndewa Imulungu katulongela, ‘Segeleni muloke bonde da Zeledi.’ Avo tuloka bonde da Zeledi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Ibita miyaka malongo madatu na nane tangu vitusegele Kadeshi Balinea mbaka vitulokile bonde da Zeledi. Kipindi acho iwanhu wose wadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo wafa, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyaiduwile wofa. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Mndewa Imulungu mwenyego kagendelela kuwakoboza ako kuna ing'hambi mbaka wose wafa.<verse eid="DEU 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>“Avo viwafile wanhu awo wadahile kuchola kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/>Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>‘Lelo moiloka imbaka ya isi ya Moabu kubitila buga da Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Mwahavika mwiisi ya Waamoni sikumuwagaze hebu kuwadovula ili kuitowa na hewo kwavija niye siwagwaa bule mweye isi ayo ya Waamoni. Niye niwagwaa isi ayo wanhu wa ulelo wa Lutu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>Vivija isi ayo yojuwigwa kamba isi ya Walefai, ako umwaka Walefai wakala mwiisi ayo. Lakini Waamoni wawagwaa twaga da Wazamuzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Wanhu awo wakala wengi na wakala na nguvu na watali kamba Waanaki. Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kawakoboza aho viwezile Waamoni awo waisola isi yao na wakala mumo. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu katenda kamba viyawatendele wanhu wa ulelo wa Esau, Waedomu, awo wakalile ako Seili. Kawakoma Waholi wose kipindi viwavikile Waedomu, waisola isi yao na wakala mumo mbaka lelo. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Waavi wakala ako aho ichanduso mna ivijiji avo mbaka Gaza. Wakafutoli kulawa kisiwa cha Kilete wawakoma wose, na hewo wakala mwiisi ayo hanhu hao.<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>“Abaho Mndewa Imulungu katulongela, ‘Avo, songeni umwanza. Lokeni kubonde da Alinoni. Niye nimgela mmakono genu Sihoni mndewa wa Waamoli wa Heshiboni na isi yake. Mtoweni abaho muisole isi yake. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>Lelo nosonga kuwatenda wanhu wose mwiisi wengile bwembwe na kuwadumba mweye, ohulika mbuli zenu na ogwaya na kunyawanyawa.’<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Sihoni kohumwa na Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Kupetigwa 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>“Avo, nituma wanhu kulawa kuluwala lwa Kedemoti wachole kwa mndewa Sihoni wa ako Heshiboni na usenga uno wa tindiwalo. <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>‘Tuleke tubitile mwiisi yako, tobita mnzila tochola bila kuhinduka ukumoso hebu ukudila. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Tuuzile ndiya na mazi ga kung'wa kwa vihande va shaba. Siye tolonda utuleke tubite mwiisi yako, <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>kamba viwatutendele iwanhu wa ulelo wa Esau okala ako Seili na wanhu wa Moabu okala ako Ali, mbaka tuloke lwanda lwa Yolidani tuvike mwiisi iyotugwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu.’<verse eid="DEU 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>“Lakini Sihoni mndewa wa Heshiboni katulemela sikutubite mwiisi yake. Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kaditenda zoyo jake diwe dala na yawe msede ili yamgele mmakono genu na muisole isi yake kamba viili lelo.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>“Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Sambi nimgela mmakono genu mndewa Sihoni na isi yake, songeni kuisola isi yake iwe yenu.’” <verse eid="DEU 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Abaho mndewa Sihoni kalawa na wakalizi wake wose weza kuitowa na siye behi ya buga da Yahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu kamgela mmakono getu na siye tumkoma, hamoja na wanage wa kimbigalo na iwakalizi wake wose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>Kipindi acho tugananga mabuga gao gose na tuwakoma wose, wambigalo na watwanzi na iwana. Hatumulekile munhu yoyose mgima. <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>Vinhu vose vikalile kuko vikala vetu, fugo yose na ivinhu vose va kudibuga dijo. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Kusongela Aloeli buga dili kumgwazo wa kubonde da Alinoni na buga dili kumgwazo wa bonde da Gileadi, kuduhu buga dikalile digangamale mbaka siye tulemelwe kudisola. Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, kagagela mmakono getu mabuga gose. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Lakini hatuikwesele isi ya Waamoni hebu mwiingema ya lwanda lwa Yaboki hebu mwiisi ya kuvigongo hebu hanhu hohose hayatugomese Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Ogu kohumwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Kupetigwa 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>“Abaho tuhinduka tugoga inzila ichola Bashani. Mndewa Ogu wa ako Bashani keza na iwakalizi wake ili yatuvamile ako behi ya buga da Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Sikuumdumbe kwavija nimgela mmakono gako, heyo hamoja na iwakalizi wake na isi yake yose. Komtendela kamba viumtendele Sihoni, imndewa wa Waamoli, ayo yakalile ako Heshiboni.’<verse eid="DEU 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>“Avo, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu kamgela mmakono getu Ogu imndewa wa Bashani hamoja na iwakalizi wake wose, tuwakoma wose na hasigale hata munhu imoja. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>Tugasola mabuga gose, haduhu hata buga dimoja tudilekile. Gose kwa gose gakala mabuga malongo sita, isi yose ya Aligobu iyakalile mndewa Ogu wa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>Mabuga gose ago gazungulusilwa senyenge nhali, kukala na milango na vihindilo. Vivija kukala na vijiji vingi vikalile havizungulusilwe senyenge. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>Tubananga kila buga, na tuwakoma iwambigalo na iwatwanzi na iwana kamba vitutendile kuna gamabuga ga mndewa Sihoni wa Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>Lakini fugo yose na ivinhu vose viyagwe tuvisola.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>“Avo kipindi acho tuisola isi ya awo iwandewa wabili wa Waamoli wakalile ako mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, hagati ya lwanda lwa Alinoni na lugongo lwa Helimoni.” <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>Wasidoni okikema kigongo acho Silioni na Waamoli okikema Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>Musa kagendelela kulonga, “Tugasola mabuga gose geli kudibawe, na isi yose ya Gileadi na Bashani mbaka Saleka na Edilei gamabuga ga mndewa Ogu wa ako Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>Mndewa Ogu wa ako Bashani ayo yaiyeka yasigale hagati ya Walefai, lusazi lwake lutendigwa kwa zuma, na lukala na utali wa makono mane na ugazi wa makono mabili, kamba iwanhu viwapimaga. Lusazi alo lung'hali kuko ako Laba buga da Waamoni.<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila gokala umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Kupetigwa 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>“Vituisolile isi ayo niwagwaa iwanhu wa makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi umwambu wa kasikazini wa Aloeli behi na kubonde da Alinoni na nusu ya ivigongo va Gileadi hamoja na mabuga gake. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>Hanhu hasigale ha Gileadi hamoja na isi yose ya Bashani ya mndewa Ogu, ndio kulonga isi yose ya Aligobu, niwagwaa nusu ya kabila da Manase.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">Isi yose ya Bashani ijuwigwa kamba isi ya Walefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Yaili kulawa kabila da Manase kasola hanhu hose ha isi ya Aligobu ako Bashani mbaka kuna imbaka ya Wageshuli na Wamaaka. Vijiji vose kavigwaa twaga jake na mbaka lelo vojuwigwa kamba vijiji va Hawoti Yaili.<verse eid="DEU 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>“Wanhu wa ulelo wa Makili kulawa kabila da Manase, niwagwaa isi ya Gileadi, <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>na wanhu wa makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi niwagwaa isi yose kulawa Gileadi mbaka lwanda lwa Alinoni. Imbaka yao kwa umwambu wa kusini ikala hagati ya ulwanda na imbaka yao kwa umwambu wa kasikazini ikala kuna ulwanda lwa Yaboki awo uibakane na isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>Umwambu wa kudihongela zuwa isi yao ivika mbaka lwanda lwa Yolidani, kulawa lamba da Kineleti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vivija </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lamba da Kineleti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dojuwika kamba lamba da Galilaya.</char></note> umwambu wa kasikazini, mbaka bahali ya Alaba, vivija yojuwigwa kamba bahali ya Mkele, mbaka kumuhulumuko wa Pisiga umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>“Kipindi acho niwagwaa malagizo gano, ‘Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawagwaa isi ino ili umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Yolidani, muisole. Avo mweye mudahaga kuitowa mwiing'hondo, soleni migoha yenu muloke ulwanda lwa Yolidani kuwalongolela ndugu zenu Waizilaeli waenu. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Lakini wehe zenu na wanenu na zifugo zenu nyingi zimwili nazo, awo osigala mna gamabuga ganiwagwelele. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Watazeni ndugu zenu Waizilaeli mbaka Mndewa Imulungu vonda yawatende wakale hanhu hao kamba viyatendile kumwenu, na hewo vivija waisole isi ija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagwaa, ako umwambu wa Yolidani. Abaho kila munhu kumwenu kobwela mwiisi yenu ino iniwagwelele iwe yenu.’<verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>“Abaho nimulagiza Yoshua, ‘Gweye kona kwa meso gako gaja gose Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako gayawatendele iwandewa wano wabili, Sihoni na Ogu. Avo, heyo kowatendela vivo iwandewa wose wa ziisi zimuchola kuzisola. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>Sikumuwadumbe, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu koitowa na hewo mbuli yenu.’<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kogomesigwa kwingila mwiisi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>“Kipindi acho nimpula Mndewa Imulungu, nilonga, <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>‘Go Mndewa, Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu nojuwa kunilagusila niye msang'hanaji wako hanhu hadodo ha ukulu wako na udahi wako. Vino hana imulungu gani kuulanga hebu mwiisi yodaha kusang'hana mbuli ng'hulu kamba ziusang'hane gweye? <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Nokupula unileke niloke ulwanda lwa Yolidani, niyone isi ayo inogile ako umwambu wa kudihongela zuwa wa Yolidani, niilole isi ayo inogile, isi ya vigongo, hamoja na vigongo va Lebanoni.’<verse eid="DEU 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>“Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanigevuzikila niye mbuli yenu, kalema kunitegeleza. Lakini kanilongela, ‘Nyamala vivo, sikuunongele kabili mbuli ayo! <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Kwela mbaka kuna inhembeti ya ulugongo lwa Pisiga na ulole goya umwambu wa kudihongela zuwa na umwambu wa kasikazini na umwambu wa kusini na umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa. Uilole isi ayo kwa meso gako, lakini gweye huloka bule ulwanda uno wa Yolidani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Lakini umgwelele Yoshua malagizo, na umgele moyo na umtende yagangamale, kwavija heyo ayo yonda yawalongoze iwanhu wano mbaka ako umwambu, waisole isi yonda uilole.’<verse eid="DEU 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>“Avo tukala kuko kubonde kuulongozi wa Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kugoga malagizo ga Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Musa kagendelela kuwalongela Waizilaeli, “Gogeni na kukweleleza malagizo na mafundizo gose ganiwafunzile, ili muwe wagima na kuisola isi yonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Sikumwengeze kinhu chochose hebu kusegesa kinhu chochose mna gamalagizo goniwagwelela, lakini gagogeni malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, gano goniwagwelela. <verse eid="DEU 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>Mwenye mugona kwa meso genu gaja gayatendile Mndewa Imulungu ako Baali Peoli. Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kawakoma iwanhu wose hagati yenu wamtambikile ayo imulungu Baali Peoli. <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Lakini mweye mose mumtamanile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu mung'hali wagima mbaka lelo.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>“Loleni, niwafunza malagizo na mafundizo kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu viyanilagize nitende, ili mugakweleleze ako kuna iisi yumuchola kuisola. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Gagogeni na kugakweleleza gago kwavija mwahatenda vivo iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe vonda wagajuwe, ojuwa kamba mweye muna nzewele na ubala na olonga, ‘Wanhu wa isi ino ng'hulu wana nzewele na wabala!’<verse eid="DEU 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>“Kuduhu wanhu wa isi yoyose, hata kamba isi yao ng'hulu, imulungu wao kokala behi na hewo kamba viyali behi na siye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, twahampula yatutaze. <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Vivija kuduhu wanhu wa isi yoyose, hata kamba isi yao ng'hulu, wana malagizo na mafundizo ga haki, kamba gago ganiwafunzile lelo.<verse eid="DEU 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>“Muiteganye na mugelegeze, sikumuisemwe gaja gamugonile kwa meso genu wenyego. Sikumuisemwe gago mna imizoyo yenu muugima wenu wose. Wasimulileni wanenu na iwazukulu zenu, <verse eid="DEU 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>siku ayo vumwimile kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ako Holebu viyanilongele, ‘Wating'hanize awo iwanhu kuulongozi wangu, niwalongele mbuli zangu ili waifunze kunidumba niye, siku zose viwokala mwiisi na vivija wawafunze wanao watende vivo.’<verse eid="DEU 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>“Avo mukwesa behi na kwima hasi ya ulugongo lukalile lokwaka moto uvikile mbaka kuulanga kuno wenela ziza na wingu kulu. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kalonga na mweye kulawa muumoto awo. Muzihulika mbuli ziyalongile lakini hammone, mweye muihulika sauti yake iiyeka. <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>Kawalongela lagano jake, na kawalagiza mugagoge gaja Gamalagizo Longo, gayandike mna ivibao vibili va mabwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Kipindi acho Mndewa Imulungu kanilagiza niwafunze malagizo na mafundizo gomulondigwa kugagoga mwiisi yumuchola kuisola.<verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ogomesigwa kutambikila vinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>“Avo, sikumuisemwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyalongile na mweye muumoto ako kulugongo lwa Holebu, hammone viyali. Avo muiteganye ng'hani, <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>sikumuinange na kutenda kinyago, hebu sisila da kinhu chochose kiwe kamba mbigalo hebu mtwanzi, <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>hebu mnyama yoyose mwiisi hebu ndege, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>hebu mng'onyo yoyose yotambala hebu somba weli mgamazi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Muiteganye, mwahalola uchanha kuulanga na kujona zuwa na mbalamwezi na nhondo na vinhu viyagwe vili kuulanga, sikumvikwesele na kuvitambikila na kuvisang'hanila, kwavija vinhu avo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kavilumba mbuli ya iwanhu wose wayagwe iwokala mwiisi wavitambikile. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Lakini mweye awo yawakombole kulawa Misili mulawe mditanuli da zuma. Kawalava kuko ili muwe wanhu zake kamba vimwili lelo. <verse eid="DEU 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>Kwa mbuli yenu Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kanigevuzikila, kaiduwila kamba niye siloka bule ulwanda lwa Yolidani na kwingila mwiisi ija inogile iyowagwaa iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>Avo niye nofila mwiisi ino, siloka bule umwambu wa ulwanda, lakini mweye, sambi moloka ulwanda na mochola kuisola isi ayo inogile. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Muiteganye sikumuisemwe lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu diyatendile na mweye, na sikumutende kinyago cha kinhu chochose kiyawagomese Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kamba moto usakaza, heyo ayo Imulungu yeli na migongo.<verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>“Vonda mukale mwiisi ayo, mwahapata wana na wazukulu na mwahawa wavele, kamba mwahasonga kupotela na kutenda vinyago kwa kuigala na kinhu chochose, mwahatenda gehile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kumgevuza, <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>avo niye lelo noukema ulanga na isi vilole mbuli ino, nowalongela kamba, kwa mwanza umoja mokomigwa kuko mwiisi yumuchola kuisola ako umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. Hamukala kuko kwa siku nyingi, lakini mokomigwa mose. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowapwililisa mweye mna iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe, na iwanhu kidogo hagati yenu awo onda wasigale kuko kutali kuyawagalile Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Kuko moisang'hanila imilungu ya mibiki na mibwe, ayo itendigwe kwa makono ga wanhu, ayo haidaha kulola hebu kuhulika hebu kuja hebu kunusa. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Lakini mwahawa kuko mziisi azo na mwahamzahila Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose, heyo momona. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>Mbuli azo zose zahawapata ako kumwande, mogaya ng'hani avo kukimambukizo mombwelela na kumtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kamema bazi, honda yawaleke hebu kuwananga hebu kudisemwa lagano diyatendile kwa kuiduwila kwa iwahenga zenu.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>“Gelegezeni gaja gaumwaka, gaja galawile mweye mung'hali hamunavumbuka, kulawa siku ayo Imulungu viyamulumbile munhu. Zahileni mwiisi yose kulawa mwambu uno mbaka uyagwe, kamba kuna kinhu kamba kino cha unzonza kilawila hebu kihulikigwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>Vino kuna wanhu wowose waihulika sauti ya Imulungu kamba vimuihulike mweye yolonga kulawa mmoto, abaho wasigala wagima? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>Vino kuna imulungu yoyose iyagwe yagezile kusola iwanhu wake kulawa mwiisi ya iwanhu wayagwe, kamba viyatendile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu? Heyo katenda avo kwa magazo na vilaguso na unzonza na ng'hondo na kwa nguvu yake ng'hulu, katenda vinhu vigela bwembwe na mweye mugona gose ago kwa meso genu ako Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>Mweye muzona mbuli azo, ili mujuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu yaiyeka na haduhu iyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>Kulawa kuulanga kawatenda muihulike sauti yake ili yawafunze kumtegeleza, na hano mwiisi kawatenda muwone moto wake mkulu, na muzihulika mbuli zake kulawa muumoto awo. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>Kwavija kawanogela wahenga zenu na kawasagula mweye na kawalava kulawa mwiisi ya Misili kwa nguvu na udahi, <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>kawawinga mgameso genu wanhu wa isi zili na nguvu kubanza mweye, ili yawagale na kuwagwaa isi yao iwe yenu, kamba viili mbaka lelo. <verse eid="DEU 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>Avo, muijuwe mbuli ino na muigelegeze mmizoyo yenu, kamba Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu ako kuulanga na hasi mwiisi, na kuduhu iyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Gogeni gaja gayalongile na malagizo gake goniwagwaa lelo, ili mugendelele goya mweye na wanenu baho kumwande na mukale siku nyingi mwiisi ayo iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu siku zose.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuga ga kukimbilila iwanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Abaho Musa kagabagula mabuga madatu ako umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>ako munhu yahamkoma munhu bila kulonda, kodaha kukimbilila buga dimoja mna gamabuga gago na kouhonya ugima wake. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Kadibagula buga da Bezeli dili kudibawe da ikiwala kawagwelela wanhu wa kabila da Lubeni, na buga da Lamoti mwiisi ya Gileadi kawagwelela iwanhu wa kabila da Gadi na buga da Golani mwiisi ya Bashani kawagwelela iwanhu wa kabila da Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa malagizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Gano gago malagizo gawagweleligwe wanhu wa Izilaeli na Musa. <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Gano gago galondigwe na mafundizo na malagizo Musa gayawalongele Waizilaeli viwalawile mwiisi ya Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>na wakala kubonde behi ya Beti Peoli mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, mwiisi ya mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli, yatawale ako Heshiboni abaho kahumwa na Musa na iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli viwezile kulawa mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>Waisola isi yake na isi ya mndewa Ogu wa isi ya Bashani. Wandewa awo iwabili wa Waamoli watawala kuko umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>Isi ayo yenela kulawa kudibuga da Aloeli mwiingema ya lwanda lwa Alinoni, mbaka kulugongo lwa Silioni, vivija lokemigwa Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>hamoja na isi yose ya umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yolidani mbaka bahali ya Alaba, kuhumulukila kulugongo lwa Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo Longo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kulawa 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Musa kawakema wanhu wose wa Izilaeli na kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, tegelezeni mafundizo na malagizo goniwalongela lelo. Ifunzeni na mugagoge goya. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, katenda lagano na siye ako kulugongo lwa Holebu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Hatendile lagano dino na iwahenga zetu, lakini katenda na siye wose tuli wagima lelo. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kalonga na mweye meso kwa meso kulawa kuko kulugongo hagati ya umoto. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Kipindi acho niye ng'hala nimile hagati yenu na Mndewa Imulungu, na niwalongela gaja gayalongile, kwavija mweye mudumba uja umoto na hamukwelile kulugongo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>‘Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako nikulavile mwiisi ya Misili, kuko kuukalile mtumwa.<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>“ ‘Sikuumtambikile imulungu yoyose iyagwe ila niye.<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>“ ‘Sikuutende kinyago kiigalile na kinhu chochose kili kuulanga hebu mwiisi hebu mgamazi hasi ya isi ili ukitambikile. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>Sikuuvifugamile hebu kuvitambikila, kwavija niye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako nina migongo. Nowakoboza wana mbuli ya nzambi za tata zao, hata ulelo wa kadatu na wa ikane wa waja onihila. <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>Lakini nowatendela ganogile maelufu ga ulelo ga wanhu waja oninogela na kugagoga malagizo gangu.<verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>“ ‘Sikuuditambule bule twaga jangu, niye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, kwavija niye Mndewa Imulungu sileka kumkoboza munhu yoyose yoditambula bule twaga jangu. <verse eid="DEU 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>Ikumbuke siku ya kubwihila kwa kuitenda ing'ale kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako viyakulagize. <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>Kwa siku sita usang'hane na utende mbuli zako zose, <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>lakini siku ya saba, siku ya kubwihila ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako. Siku ayo sikuusang'hane sang'hano yoyose, gweye mwenyego hebu mwanago wa kimbigalo hebu wa kitwanzi hebu mtumwa wako wa kimbigalo hebu wa kitwanzi hebu ng'ombe wako hebu kihongwe wako hebu mnyama wako yoyose, hebu munhu baki iyokala mwiisi yako, ili mtumwa wako wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi wabwihile kamba viubwihila gweye. <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>Kumbuka kamba gweye kukala mtumwa ako mwiisi ya Misili, na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, kakulava kuko kwa udahi wake mkulu, avo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kakulagiza uigoge siku ya kubwihila.<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>“ ‘Wategeleze tatako na mamako, kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako viyakulagize, utende vivo ili ukale mgima siku nyingi na mbuli zako zokugendela goya mwiisi iyokugwelela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako.<verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>“ ‘Sikuukome.<verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>“ ‘Sikuutende ugoni.<verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>“ ‘Sikuwibe.<verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>“ ‘Sikuumulavile miyago usindila wa uvizi.<verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>“ ‘Sikuumsulukile mwehe wa miyago, sikuuisulukile ng'anda ya miyago hebu mgunda wake hebu mtumwa wake wa kimbigalo hebu wa kitwanzi hebu ng'ombe wake hebu kihongwe wake hebu kinhu chochose kiyelinacho.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>“Gano gago malagizo gayalongile Mndewa Imulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu kulawa muumoto na mdiwingu na ziza totolo vimuiting'hane ako kulugongo na hongeze mbuli yoyose. Abaho kagandika malagizo gago mna ivibao vibili va mabwe na kanigwaa niye.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu odumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kulawa 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>“Vimuihulike sauti yake kulawa mdiziza totolo, na uchanha ya lugongo lukalile lokwaka, ivilongozi wenu wa makabila na iwavele wenu weza kumwangu, <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>walonga, ‘Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu katulagusila ukulu wake na udahi wake, tuihulika sauti yake kulawa hagati ya umoto. Lelo tumona Imulungu kolonga na wanhu, na iwanhu wang'hali wagima. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Lakini sambi habali tufe? Moto uno mkulu otusakaza, na siye tofa kamba twahaihulika kabili sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>Vino, munhu gani yahulike sauti ya Imulungu yeli mgima kolonga kulawa hagati ya umoto, kamba vituhulike siye, abaho kawa mgima? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>Gweye uchole behi, ukategeleze gose goyolonga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, abaho utulongele gose gonda yakulongele. Siye togategeleza na kugagoga.’<verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>“Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kawahulika vimulongile vivo, avo kanilongela, ‘Nigahulika gose gawalongile iwanhu wano, walonga goya. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>Maza wagelegezaga vivo siku zose na kunidumba niye na kugoga malagizo gangu! Wahagendelele vinogile hewo wenyego na ulelo wao siku zose. <verse eid="DEU 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>Genda kawalongele wabwele mvibanda vao. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Lakini gweye wime baha behi na niye, na niye nokulongela gaja golondigwa na malagizo gose na mafundizo gonda uwafunze wagoge ako mwiisi iniwagwelela iwe yao.’<verse eid="DEU 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>“Avo, muiteganye musang'hane kamba viyawalagize Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, gagogeni gose na sikumuleke kinhu chochose. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Kwelelezeni gose gayawalagize Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ili muwe wagima na mugendelele goya na mukale siku nyingi mwiisi yonda muisole.<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mnogele Mndewa Imulungu wako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>“Gano gago malagizo na mafundizo na gaja golondigwa na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kanilagiza niwafunze ili mugagoge ako mwiisi yumuchola kuisola iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>Siku zose vimwili wagima mumdumbe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na mugoge malagizo gake gose na mafundizo goniwagwelela mweye na ulelo wenu ili mukale siku nyingi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Avo tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, mugagoge goya ili mugendelele goya na mwengezeke ng'hani mwiisi imemile maziwa na uki, kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zenu viyalongile.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>“Avo tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, ayo Imulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="DEU 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>Mnogeleni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa loho yako yose na kwa nguvu zako zose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>Sikumugasemwe malagizo gano goniwagwaa lelo. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>Muwafunze wanenu, muwasimulile mwahakala ukae hebu mwahawa mmwanza hebu mwahawasa ikilo hebu imitondo mwahalamuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>Gafungeni mmakono genu na mugavale mvihanga venu kamba kinhu cha kukumbuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>Gandikeni uchanha ya milango ya ng'anda zenu na mzinyivi za kwingilila mmabuga genu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ozumigwa mbuli ya kulema kumtegeleza Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yawagale mwiisi iyaiduwile kwa wahenga zenu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, kamba kowagwaa mweye isi ayo ili na mabuga makulu na ganogile ago hagazengigwe na mweye, <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>na ng'anda zimemile vinhu vinogile havikigwe na mweye, na visima hamuvihimbile na migunda ya mizabibu na mizeituni haihandigwe na mweye. Avo mwahaja na kwiguta, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>muiteganye sikumumsemwe Mndewa Imulungu, yawalavile mwiisi ya Misili ako kumukalile watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Mdumbeni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mumsang'hanile heyo yaiyeka, na muiduwile kwa twaga jake. <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Sikumuikweleleze imilungu iyagwe, imilungu ya wanhu wawazunguluke mweye, <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>kwavija mwahaikweleleza, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yeli hagati yenu heyo Imulungu yeli na migongo, na kwa ng'hasiliki yake kowakoma wose sikumoneke mwiisi yose.<verse eid="DEU 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>“Sikumumgeze Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kamba vimutendile ako Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Mulole goya mugagoge malagizo gose gayawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na mafundizo na gaja golondigwa gayawalagize. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>Musang'hane gaja ganogile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, ili mugendelele goya na mwingile na kuisola isi inogile iyalongile kwa kuiduwila kowagwaa wahenga zenu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>na kowaswaswanya iwanhu wose owehila kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyalongile.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>“Ako kumwande wanenu wahawauza, ‘Habali Mndewa Imulungu katulagiza tugagoge malagizo na gamafundizo na gaja golondigwa?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>Mweye muwedike, ‘Siye tukala watumwa wa Falao ako Misili, lakini Mndewa Imulungu katulava mwiisi ya Misili kwa nguvu zake ng'hulu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Kwa meso getu Mndewa Imulungu katenda unzonza na vilaguso vidumbiza na va kukanganya kwa Wamisili na mndewa wao na iwanhu wa mng'anda yake. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>Katulava Misili na katugala hano na katugwaa isi ino kamba viyaiduwile kowagwaa iwahenga zetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu katulagiza tugoge malagizo gano gose na tumdumbe heyo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu ili tumwede na tukale wagima kamba vitwili lelo. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>Totendigwa tunoge mgameso gake kamba twahagoga goya malagizo gano gayatulagize Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu.’<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kulawa 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yawavikize mwiisi yumuchola kuisola, na kowawinga wanhu wa isi nyingi wasegele mwiisi ayo. Vonda mwingile kowawinga wanhu wa isi saba, isi zili na nguvu na wanhu wengi kubanza mweye, isi za Wahiti na Wagiligashi na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, vonda yawagele mmakono genu na mowahuma iwanhu awo avo muwakome wose, sikumutende lagano na hewo na sikumuwonele bazi. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Sikumuisolele watwanzi na hewo, na sikumuwaleke wanenu wa kimbigalo wawasole wandele zao hebu wanenu wa kitwanzi wasoligwe na hewo. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Mwahatenda vivo hewo owatenda wanenu wamuleke Mndewa Imulungu, na owatenda waitambikile imilungu iyagwe, avo ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu yowakila na hakawa kuwananga wose. <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Lakini watendeleni vino, bomoleni mhango zao za kulavila nhosa na mugasegese mabwe gao ga kutambikila. Na vikanheni ivinyago vao va Ashela na mvisome moto vinyago vao viyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Tendeni vivo kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wang'alile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Mna iwanhu wose mwiisi yose kawasagula mweye ili muwe wanhu zake mwenyego.<verse eid="DEU 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>“Mndewa Imulungu hawanogele mweye na kuwasagula kwavija mwa wengi kubanza wanhu wayagwe, mweye mwa wadodo kubanza iwanhu wose mwiisi. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Lakini kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kawanogela mweye na katenda kija kiyaiduwile kwa wahenga zenu, lekaavo kawalava kwa nguvu zake ng'hulu na kawagombola muutumwa, kulawa mmakono ga Falao mndewa wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Avo, mujuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu heyo Imulungu yotamaniligwa, kogoga lagano jake na kolagusa unogelwa wake kwa maelufu ga ulelo kwa waja ogoga malagizo gake. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Lakini kwa waja omwihila, hakawa bule kuwaliha kwa kuwakoboza. <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Avo, muiteganye mugoge malagizo na mafundizo na gaja golondigwa goniwalagiza lelo.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumweda kwa iwanhu omtegeleza Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Kumbukumbu 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>“Kamba mwahagagoga malagizo gano na kutenda kamba vigalonga, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kogendelela kugoga lagano jake na mweye na kowanogela kamba viyaiduwile kwa wahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>Heyo kowanogela na kowatenda mumwede, mokwengezeka na mokuwa wengi, koitenda migunda yenu ilele ng'hani, ili mupate ndiya na divai na mavuta. Kowatendela ganogile kwa kuwagwaa ng'ombe na ng'hondolo wengi mwiisi ayo iyaiduwile kowagwaa iwahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>Momweda kubanza wanhu wose wa mwiisi. Kuduhu mbigalo hebu mtwanzi yonda yawe mgumba. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowasegesela mitamu, na kowatenda sikumupate mitamu ihile kamba yumuyonile ako Misili, lakini kowagwaa mitamu ayo iwanhu owehila. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>Muwakome wanhu wose wa isi zose Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu yazigelile mmakono genu, na sikumuwonele bazi. Sikumvitambikile vinyago vao, kwavija mbuli ayo yowahonza.<verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>“Sikumugelegeze mmizoyo yenu, ‘Wanhu wano wengi ng'hani kubanza siye, todahaze kuwawinga mwiisi?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Sikumuwadumbe, kumbukeni gaja Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, gayamtendele Falao na iwanhu wose wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>Kumbukeni imitamu ihile imuyonile kwa meso genu, unzonza na vilaguso na udahi na nguvu ng'hulu ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu yaisang'hanile kuwakombola, na kotenda vivo kwa iwanhu wose omuwadumba. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagalila midondola hagati ya hewo, na kowakoma waja wakimbile na kuifisa. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Avo, sikumuwadumbe kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kahamoja na mweye. Heyo kana udahi na nguvu. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowawinga wanhu wa isi azo, kidogo kidogo kila vimgendelela. Hamudaha kuwakoma wose kwa siku dimoja, kwavija mwahatenda vivo iming'onyo ya kumuhulo yokuwa mingi na kuwadumbiza. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagela mmakono genu iwanhu owehila na kowatenda wadununzike mbaka wamale kukomigwa. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>Kowagela mmakono genu iwandewa zao. Mowakoma na hewo osemwigwa, na mowakoma wose na kuduhu munhu yonda yawagomese. <verse eid="DEU 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Visomeni moto ivinyago va imilungu yao. Sikumusulukile shaba hebu zahabu ili mvinyago vao na sikumuisole na kuitenda kamba yenu. Mbuli ayo yowahonza na yomgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Sikumukigale mzing'anda zenu kinhu chochose kimgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, buleavo moduwiligwa kamba kinhu acho. Sikumuvinogele hebu kuvigelegeza kwavija vinhu avo viduwiligwa.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s">Isi inogile ya kuisola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>“Muiteganye mugoge malagizo gose goniwagwaa lelo, ili muwe wagima na mongezeke na mwingile na kuisola isi ayo iyaiduwile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa iwahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>Kumbukeni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyawalongoze mmwanza mtali kubitila kuluwala kwa miyaka malongo mane, ili yawasegesele kuitapa na kawageza yagajuwe gaja geli mmizoyo yenu, kamba mogoga hebu hamugoga malagizo gake. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>Kawasegesela kuitapa kwa kuwatenda mukone nzala, abaho kawagwaa ndiya ya mana muje, ndiya ayo hamuijuwile na vivija iwahenga zenu hawaijuwile. Katenda avo ili yawafunze kamba munhu hadaha kuwa mgima kwa kuja kwiiyeka lakini kwa kila mbuli ilawa mmulomo wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>Kipindi chose acho cha miyaka malongo mane, viwalo venu havilalile na magulu genu hagavimbile bule. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Avo muvijuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowazuma mweye kamba tata viyomzuma mwanage. <verse eid="DEU 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Avo, gogeni malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, ili mukweleleze nzila zake na mumdumbe heyo. <verse eid="DEU 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagala mwiisi inogile isi ili na vizanda na nzasa na mbwibwi ikilima kulawa kuvigongo na kubonde, <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>isi ilelaga ngano na shaili na mizabibu na mitini na mikomamanga na mizeituni na uki. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>Ako mopata ndiya nyingi na hamuswela kinhu. Mibwe yake ina chuma na kuvigongo vake modaha kuhimba shaba ya kiguzi. <verse eid="DEU 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Moja na mokwiguta, na momtogola Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa isi inogile iyawagwelele.<verse eid="DEU 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ozumigwa mbuli ya kumsemwa Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>“Muiteganye sikumumsemwe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa kuleka kugoga malagizo gake na mafundizo gake na gaja golondigwa goniwalagiza lelo. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Mwahaja na kwiguta, mwahazenga ng'anda zinogile na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>na kamba ng'ombe na ng'hondolo wenu na shaba na zahabu yenu na kila kinhu kimulinacho chongezeka, <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>avo sikumuitape na kumsemwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yawalavile mwiisi ya Misili, ako kumukalile watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>Heyo kawalongoza ako kuluwala lukulu ludumbiza, lumemile mizoka ili na sumu na inge, mwiisi ija inyalile ilibule mazi, kawalavila mazi kulawa mdibwe dala. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>Heyo kawagwaa mana ako kuluwala, ndiya haijuwigwe na iwahenga zenu. Katenda vivo ili yawasegesele kuitapa na yawageze ili ako kumwande yawatendele ganogile. <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Avo muiteganye sikumulonge mmizoyo yenu, ‘Siye tuwa matajili kwa nguvu zetu na udahi wetu wenyego.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Kumbukeni kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ayo yowagwaa nguvu ya kuwa matajili. Kotenda vivo mbuli ya lagano jake diyaiduwile kwa iwahenga zenu mbaka lelo. <verse eid="DEU 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>Kamba mwahamsemwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kuikweleleza imilungu iyagwe na kuisang'hanila na kuitambikila, lelo nowazuma kamba mokomigwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>Kamba hamumtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu mokomigwa kamba vonda yawakome iwanhu wa isi zili kuulongozi wenu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s">Siyo mbuli ya ukunoga kwa iwanhu wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kulawa 32:1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>“Mutegeleze mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, sambi moloka lwanda lwa Yolidani na mochola kuisola isi ya wanhu wa isi ng'hulu na weli na nguvu kubanza mweye. Mabuga gao makulu na gazunguluswa senyenge ivikile mbaka kuna gamawingu. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>Wanhu wenyego watali na wana nguvu, awo Waanaki na kamba vimujuwa na kamba vimuhulika iwanhu viwalongaga, ‘Nani yodaha kuitowa na Waanaki?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Lakini lelo muvijuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, ayo yowalongolela kamba moto usakaza. Heyo kowakoma na kowahuma mgameso genu, avo mowawinga na kuwakoma himahima, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyawalongele kotenda.<verse eid="DEU 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yamambukize kuwawinga iwanhu awo mgameso genu sikumugelegeze mmizoyo yenu, ‘Kwavija siye tunoga lekaavo Mndewa Imulungu katugala tuisole isi ino.’ Mndewa Imulungu kawawinga iwanhu wano mgameso genu kwavija hewo otenda gehile. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Mweye moisola isi ya hewo siyo kwavija mweye munoga hebu mizoyo yenu inoga ila Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowawinga iwanhu awo mgameso genu kwavija watenda gehile na kolonda kudivikiza dija dilagano diyaiduwile kwa iwahenga zenu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>Avo, muvijuwe siyo mbuli ya ganogile genu Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowagwaa isi ino inogile iwe yenu, kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wadala.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>“Kumbukeni na sikumuisemwe vimumgevuze Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kuja kuluwala. Tangu siku dija dimusegele mwiisi ya Misili mbaka vimuvikile hanhu hano, mweye momulema Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Akuja kulugongo lwa Holebu mumgevuza Mndewa Imulungu na heyo kagevuzika ng'hani na kalonda kuwakoma wose. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>Vinikwelile kulugongo kusola ivibao vibili va mabwe, vandikigwe lagano diyatendile Mndewa Imulungu na mweye, ng'hala kuko kulugongo kwa siku malongo mane imisi na ikilo sidile gate hebu kung'wa mazi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanigwaa avo ivibao vibili va mabwe vandikigwe kwa kidole chake Imulungu. Vikala vandikigwe mbuli zose ziyawalongele Mndewa Imulungu kulugongo, kulawa muumoto siku ayo vimuiting'hane. <verse eid="DEU 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Ona, vizishile siku azo malongo mane imisi na ikilo, Mndewa Imulungu kanigwaa avo ivibao vibili va mabwe, vandikigwe dilagano.<verse eid="DEU 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>“Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Segela, hima uhumuluke hasi ya ulugongo, kwavija wanhu zako wauwalavile Misili wanangika. Sambi sambi waileka nzila, iniwalagize waikweleleze, watenda kinyago cha zuma.’<verse eid="DEU 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>“Vivija Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Niwona wanhu wano wadala ng'hani, <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>nileke niwakome, nisegese twaga jao mwiisi yose, abaho nokutenda gweye isi ili na nguvu na ng'hulu kubanza hewo.’<verse eid="DEU 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>“Avo, nihinduka na nihumuluka kulawa kulugongo, lukalile lokwaka moto, kuno nipapa ivibao vibili va mabwe. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>Vindolile nyona mumtenda nzambi Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, muitendela kinyago cha ng'ombe cha zahabu, kwa kipindi kidodo muileka nzila iyawalagize Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>Avo, nivigoga vija ivibao vibili nivipigisa hasi, nivibena mgameso genu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>Abaho nigwa kingubanguba kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu kwa siku malongo mane imisi na ikilo, kamba vinhendile ichanduso, sidile gate hebu sing'wile mazi, mbuli ya nzambi zenu zimutendile, kwa kutenda gehile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu na mumtenda yagevuzike. <verse eid="DEU 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>Nidumba ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu, yahawakomile, lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanhegeleza kabili. <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu kamgevuzikila ng'hani Haluni na kalonda kumkoma, avo vivija nimpulila Haluni kipindi acho. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>Akija ikinhu cha nzambi kimutendile, acho ikinyago cha ng'ombe, nikisola nikilumbula muumoto, abaho nikihonda honda na nipata timbwisi na nidipigisa timbwisi ajo mna ikizanda cha mazi gokilima hasi ya ulugongo.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>“Vivija mumgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ako Tabela na Masa na Kibiloti Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>Na Mndewa Imulungu viyawatumile kulawa Kadeshi Balinea kalonga, ‘Gendeni mukaisole isi iniwagwelele,’ mweye mmulema Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na hamumtogole na hamugagogile gaja gayawalongele. <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Mweye mmulema Mndewa Imulungu tangu siku viniwajuwile.<verse eid="DEU 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>“Avo nigwa kingubanguba kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu kwa siku azo malongo mane, imisi na kilo, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala yalongile kowakoma wose. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>Nimpula Mndewa Imulungu, nilonga, ‘Go, Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu sikuuwabanange wanhu wako, wanhu wano kuwakombola kulawa mwiisi ya Misili kwa udahi wako na nguvu ng'hulu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>Wakumbuke wasang'hanaji zako, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, na sikuugelegeze udala wa wanhu wano na gehile gao na nzambi zao. <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>Buleavo iwanhu wa kuja kuutulavile olonga kamba Mndewa Imulungu kawalava ili yawakome kuluwala kwavija kalemelwa kuwagala mwiisi iyalongile kowagwaa, na kwavija kawehila. <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Lakini wano wanhu wako, wanhu wauwalavile kulawa Misili kwa nguvu na udahi wako mkulu.’<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s">Musa kobokela kabili Malagizo Longo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kulawa 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>“Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Songola vibao vibili va mabwe kamba vija va ichanduso, na utende sanduku da mbao, abaho ukwele kuno kulugongo kumwangu, <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>na niye nokwandika mvibao vivo mbuli zizija zikalile zandikigwe mvibao vija viubenile, abaho uvigele ivibao vivo mdisanduku.’<verse eid="DEU 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>“Avo, nitenda sanduku da mbiki wa mkese na nisongola ivibao vibili va mabwe kamba vija va ichanduso, abaho nivigoga mmakono nikwela navo uchanha kulugongo. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kandika mna ivibao vivo mbuli zizija kamba za ichanduso. Gaja Gamalagizo Longo gayawalongele kuja kulugongo, lukalile lokwaka moto, mna isiku ija vimuiting'hane. Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kanigwaa avo ivibao. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>Nihinduka, nihumuluka hasi kulawa kulugongo kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyanilagize, na nivigela avo ivibao mdisanduku dinhendile, na va mmo mdisanduku kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyanilagize.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>Wanhu wa Izilaeli wagendelela na mwanza kulawa kuvisima va wanhu wa ulelo wa Yaakani mbaka Moseloti. Kuko Haluni kafa na kazikigwa. Imwana Eleazali kasola isang'hano ya ulava nhosa. <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Kulawa kuko wachola mbaka Gudigoda na kulawa Gudigoda mbaka Yotibata, hanhu heli na vizanda vingi va mazi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>Kipindi acho, Mndewa Imulungu kawasagula iwanhu wa kabila da Lawi wadipape sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, na wamsang'hanile kamba walava nhosa na wawatambikile iwanhu kwa twaga jake mbaka vino lelo. <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Lekaavo wanhu wa kabila da Lawi wabule uhazi wa isi kamba Waizilaeli wayao. Mndewa Imulungu ayo uhazi wao kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyawalongele.<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>“Nikala kulugongo kwa siku malongo mane, imisi na ikilo kamba aho haichanduso. Mndewa Imulungu kanitegeleza kabili na katogola kamba hawakoma bule. <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/>Abaho kanongela, ‘Segela ugendelele na umwanza wako uwalongoze iwanhu ili wadahe kwingila na kuisola isi iniiduwile kwa wahenga zao kamba nowagwaa hewo.’<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>“Avo mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kolonda choni kumwenu, ila mumdumbe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, muzikweleleze nzila zake zose, mumnogele na mumsang'hanile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>na mugoge malagizo na mafundizo ga Mndewa Imulungu goniwagwaa lelo, mbuli ya ganogile genu wenyego. <verse eid="DEU 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Loleni, ulanga hata ulanga uli uchanha ng'hani, mwenyego Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, isi yose na vose vili mumo vake heyo. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu kawanogela iwahenga zenu na kawasagula mweye wanhu wa ulelo wa hewo muwe wanhu zake hanhu ha iwanhu wayagwe wose kamba viili lelo. <verse eid="DEU 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Avo kulawa sambi mudigoge lagano da Mndewa Imulungu mna imizoyo yenu na sikumuwe wadala kabili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania olonga, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Muingize kumbi mizoyo yenu.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ayo Imulungu wa imulungu na Mndewa wa iwandewa. Heyo ayo Imulungu mkulu na yeli na udahi na wakudumbigwa, habagula iwanhu na habokela hongo. <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>Kowagwaa haki iwana iwakiwa na wagane na kowanogela wanhu baki na kowagwaa ndiya na viwalo. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Avo, muwanogele wanhu baki, kwavija na mweye vivija mukala wanhu baki ako mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>Mdumbeni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na mumsang'hanile na mumgoge ng'hani na muiduwile kwa twaga jake. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Heyo ayo wakuigodela, heyo ayo Imulungu wenu, yawatendele mbuli zino ng'hulu na zakudumbiza, zimonile kwa meso genu wenyego. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Wahenga zenu viwacholile Misili wakala wanhu malongo saba waiyeka, lakini sambi Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawatenda muwe wengi kamba nhondo za kuulanga.<verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ng'hulu ziyatendile Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>“Mnogeleni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na mutende gaja goyolonda, siku zose gogeni malagizo gake na mafundizo gake na nzila zake. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>Lelo kumbukeni gaja gamuifunzile mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kubitila gaja gamugonile. Mweye awo mugonile siyo wanenu, mweye mona ukulu wake na udahi wake na nguvu zake, <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>na vilaguso vake na gaja gayamtendele Falao, imndewa wa Misili na isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>Gaja gayawatendele iwakalizi wa Misili, na iwafalasi wao na imituka yao ya ng'hondo, na vija viyawakulule mbahali ya Shamu, viwakalile owakweleleza mweye, na Mndewa Imulungu viyawakomile wose na wakuduhu mbaka lelo. <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Vivija kumbukeni gaja gayawatendele Mndewa Imulungu ako kuluwala vimukalile mnzila mokwiza hano, <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>na gaja gayawatendele iwazukulu wa Lubeni, Datani na Abilamu wanage Eliabu, isi viigubuke mgameso ga iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli na kuwameza hewo na iwanhu wa mng'anda mmwao na vibanda vao na fugo zao na iwasang'hanaji zao. <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>Meso genu gazona mbuli zose ng'hulu, azo ziyatendile Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukunoga kwa isi yonda muisole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>“Avo gogeni malagizo gose goniwagwaa lelo, ili mudahe kuwa na nguvu ya kuchola kuisola isi ayo, yumuloka kuisola, <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>na mukale siku nyingi mwiisi ayo imemile maziwa na uki, iyaiduwile Mndewa Imulungu kwa wahenga zenu kamba kowagwaa hewo na ulelo wao. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Isi yumuchola kuisola haiigala na isi ya Misili, ako kumulawile, ako muhandaga mbeyu na kuzigelela mazi kamba kihati. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Lakini isi yumuchola kuisola, imema vigongo na makonde, isi ayo yotowiligwa na mvula. <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>Isi ayo yokalizigwa na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu koilola goya toka chandusilo cha umwaka mbaka kuuhelelo wa umwaka.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>“Avo mwahagagoga malagizo goniwagwaa lelo, mwahamnogela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na mwahamsang'hanila kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>avo kowagwaa mvula mumsimu ulondigwa, mvula za masika na mvula za vuli, na mweye mosenga ndiya yenu na divai yenu na mavuta genu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>Koyoteza mijani mmigunda yenu mbuli ya fugo yenu na mweye moja na kwiguta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Avo, muiteganye, mizoyo yenu sikuiviziligwe, na mweye mohinduka na kuisang'hanila na kuitambikila imilungu iyagwe, <verse eid="DEU 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>baho ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu yowakila, na heyo koufunga ulanga ili mvula sikuitowe na migunda yenu sikuilele, avo hamukawa kufa mwiisi inogile iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>“Zikeni mbuli zangu zino mmizoyo yenu na mziloho zenu. Zifungeni mmakono genu na muzivale mvihanga venu kamba kinhu cha kukumbuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Wafunzeni wanenu mbuli azo, simulileni mbuli azo mwahakala mzing'anda zenu hebu mwahawa mmwanza hebu mwahawasa ikilo hebu imitondo mwahalamuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Zandikeni mbuli azo uchanha ya milango ya ng'anda zenu na mzinyivi za kwingila mmabuga genu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>ili siku zenu na siku za wanenu ziwe nyingi mna iisi Mndewa Imulungu iyaiduwile kowagwaa wahenga zenu, siku zose ulanga vonda uwe uchanha ya iisi.<verse eid="DEU 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>“Mwahagagoga goya malagizo gano gose goniwagwaa, na mwahamnogela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na kukweleleza nzila zake zose na kumgoga heyo, <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>avo Mndewa Imulungu kowawinga wanhu wa isi zose zili kuulongozi wenu, na mweye moisola isi ya wanhu wa isi zili na nguvu kubanza mweye. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Hanhu hohose honda mukanyage kwa magulu genu hokuwa henu. Zimbaka zenu zosongela kuluwala mbaka Lebanoni na kulawa lwanda lwa Fulate mbaka bahali ya Meditelania. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Kuduhu munhu yoyose yonda yadahe kugomba na mweye. Kokose konda muchole Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagela bwembwe wanhu wa isi azo ili wawadumbe kamba viyalongile kotenda.<verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>“Loleni, lelo nowekila kuulongozi wenu, kumweda na makungu, <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>momweda kamba mwahagoga malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, gano goniwagwaa lelo, <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>na mopata makungu kamba hamgagoga malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na kuileka nzila iniwalagiza lelo, na moitambikila imulungu iyagwe ayo hamuijuwile. <verse eid="DEU 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu yahawavikiza mweye mwiisi yumuchola kuisola, mulonge mbuli za kumweda kulawa kulugongo lwa Gelizimu, na mulonge mbuli za makungu kulawa kulugongo lwa Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>Vigongo avo va ako umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani, mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa wa inzila, mwiisi ya Wakanaani iwokala ako Alaba mwambu kwa mwambu na Giligali behi na mibiki mikulu ya Mole. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Molondigwa kuloka ulwanda lwa Yolidani ili muchole mukaisole isi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Avo mwahaisola na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>iteganyeni, mugagoge malagizo gose na mafundizo gose goniwagwaa lelo.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s">Hanhu ha kutambikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>“Gano gago malagizo na mafundizo gomulondigwa mugagoge goya mwiisi ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zenu, iyowagwaa muisole, siku zose zonda mukale mwiisi ayo. <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>Nangeni kila hanhu iwanhu awo hoitambikila imilungu yao, kuvigongo vitali, kuvisugulu na hasi ya imibiki mibisi. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Bomoleni kila upango wao wa kulavila nhosa, na tuleni mibwe yao ing'alile na someni moto vinyago vao va Ashela na vikanheni vinyago viyagwe va imilungu yao, ili kuvisegesa vinhu avo viwotambikila.<verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>“Vivija sikumumtambikile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa nzila ayo. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>Lakini muchole hanhu Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu honda yasagule mna gamakabila gose, ili yeke twaga jake, na muchole kuko kumtambikila. <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>Ako mugale nhosa zenu za kusoma moto na nhosa ziyagwe, mafungu genu ga longo na sadaka, nhosa zenu za kuiduwila na nhosa zenu za kulonda wenyego na wana wa chaudele wa ng'ombe zenu na ng'hondolo zenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Ako moja kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na modeng'helela mweye na wanhu wa mng'anda zenu, kwa gose gamtendile ago ganogile gayawatendele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>“Sikumutende kamba vitutenda sambi, kila munhu yatende kamba vija vimnogela heyo mwenyego, <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>kwavija mung'hali hamunakwingila hanhu ha kubwihila na kuuhazi umugweleligwa na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>Lakini vonda muloke lwanda lwa Yolidani na kukala mwiisi ayo iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe uhazi wenu, na heyo kowatenda mubwihile kulawa kwa iwanhu owehila ili mukale goya, <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>avo hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, honda yasagule kwika twaga jake, aho homulondigwa kugala kila kinhu kiniwalagize, nhosa zenu za kusoma moto na nhosa ziyagwe, mafungu genu ga longo na sadaka na nhosa zenu za kuiduwila zimuiduwile kwa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Ako modeng'helela kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mweye hamoja na wanenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi na wasang'hanaji zenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi na Walawi iwokala hamoja na mweye kwavija hewo wabule isi ili yao wenyego wala uhazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Iteganyeni sikumulave nhosa zenu za kusoma moto, kila hanhu homulonda mweye, <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>ila laveni nhosa zenu hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu kohasagula mna gamakabila genu. Aho mulave nhosa zenu za kusoma moto, na aho mutende gose ganiwalagize.<verse eid="DEU 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>“Lakini modaha kuchinja na kuja wanyama wenu hanhu hohose homukala kamba vimulonda, kamba kinhu kinogile kiyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kamba vonda yawatende mudahe. Wanhu wose, wang'alile na wafitile odaha kuja nyama azo kamba vimujaga nyama ya mhala na swala. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Lakini sikumuje damu ya iwanyama awo, ila muite hasi kamba mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Sikumuvidile vinhu vino mmabuga genu, mafungu ga longo ga ndiya zenu hebu ga divai yenu hebu gamavuta genu hebu ga wana wa chaudele wa ng'ombe wenu hebu ga ng'hondolo wenu hebu ga nhosa zenu za kuiduwila hebu ga nhosa zenu za kulonda wenyego hebu ga sadaka zenu ziyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>Lakini muvidile kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hanhu aho honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Dieni vinhu avo mweye hamoja na wanenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi na wasang'hanaji zenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi na Walawi iwokala hamoja na mweye na mudeng'helele kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa vinhu vinogile viyawatendele. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Vivija iteganyeni, sikumuwasemwe Walawi siku zose zonda mukale mwiisi yenu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yongeze isi yenu kamba viyawalongele, na mweye molonga, ‘Toja nyama,’ kwavija monogelwa kuja nyama, avo modaha kuja nyama kamba vimulonda. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>Avo, kamba hanhu aho honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwika twaga jake kutali, modaha kuchinja ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo kamba viyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu na kamba viniwalagize, modaha kuja nyama ayo mmabuga genu kamba vimulonda. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Moija nyama ayo kamba vimujaga mhala hebu swala. Munhu yoyose kodaha kuja yawe kang'ala hebu kafita. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>Lakini iteganyeni sikumuje damu, kwavija damu awo ugima avo sikumuje nyama hamoja na ugima. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Sikumuje damu ayo, ila muite hasi kamba mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Sikumuje damu, na mweye momweda na wanenu na ulelo wenu wose, kwavija motenda ganogile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>“Vinhu ving'ala vonda mulave nhosa na nhosa zenu za kuiduwila, visoleni na muvigale hanhu honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Laveni nhosa za kusoma moto na nyama na damu muupango wa nhosa wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, damu ya imnyama muite mdidako da uupango wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, lakini inyama modaha kuija. <verse eid="DEU 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Iteganyeni mugagoge gago gose ganiwalagize ili mumwede mweye hamoja na wanenu na ulelo wenu wose siku zose, kwavija motenda ganogile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sikumumtambikile imulungu iyagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu yahamambukiza kuwasegesa wanhu wa isi zili kuulongozi wenu, iwanhu awo omuchola kuisola isi yao, ili mweye mukale mwiisi yao, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>iteganyeni sikumwingile mumtego kwa kukweleleza gaja gawatendile hewo wamuwakomile. Sikumuigaze kulonda kujuwa mbuli ya imilungu yao na kulonga, ‘Vino hewo wakala oitambikila vilihi imilungu yao? Vivija na siye tuitambikile vivo’. <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Sikumumtambikile kamba vivo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwavija kila kinhu kimgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, hewo waitendela imilungu yao, na vivija wawasoma moto wanao wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi ili kuitambikila imilungu yao.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32"/>“Sang'haneni kila kinhu kamba viniwalagize, sikumongeze kinhu hebu kuhunguza kinhu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>“Yahalawila mtula ndagu hebu munhu yalotaga nzozi hagati yenu na kowagwaa kilaguso hebu kinhu cha unzonza, <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>abaho kilaguso acho hebu kinhu acho cha unzonza kilawila na heyo kolonga, ‘Tuikweleleze imilungu iyagwe na tuisang'hanile,’ imilungu hamuijuwile, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>sikumutogole mbuli za mtula ndagu ayo hebu munhu ayo yalotaga nzozi. Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowageza ili yajuwe kamba momnogela heyo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/>Mkwelelezeni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na mumdumbe na mugoge malagizo gake na mumtegeleze na mumsang'hanile na mumgoge heyo. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Lakini mtula ndagu ayo hebu munhu ayo yalotaga nzozi yakomigwe, kwavija kowafunza iwanhu wamuleme Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yawalavile mwiisi ya Misili na kuwagombola kulawa muutumwa, heyo kageza kuwatenda sikumuikweleleze nzila iyawalagize Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu muikweleleze. Muwakome ili musegese gehile hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>“Kamba ndugu yako wa usungu hebu mwanago wa ikimbigalo hebu wa ikitwanzi hebu mwehe wako yuumnogela ng'hani hebu mbwigako ng'hani, kokuteweza kinyelegezi, kolonga, ‘Tuchole tukaitambikile imilungu iyagwe.’ Milungu ayo gweye hebu wahenga zenu hawaijuile, <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>hebu imilungu ya wanhu iwokala behi na mweye hebu imilungu ya wanhu iwokala kutali kulawa mwambu umoja wa isi yose na mwambu uyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>Sikuutogole kutewezigwa na sikuumtegeleze hebu kumonela bazi hebu kumfisa, <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>lakini umkome, gweye ayo yonda usonge kumkoma munhu ayo abaho wanhu wose wayagwe okweleleza. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>Mumtowe kwa mabwe mbaka yafe, kwavija kageza kukutenda umuleke Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, yakulavile muutumwa ako mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Avo, Waizilaeli wose ohulika na kudumba, na hawatenda ng'o gehile kamba gago kabili.<verse eid="DEU 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>“Mwahahulika kudibuga dimoja mna gamabuga goyowagwelela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu mukale, <verse eid="DEU 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>kamba wanhu wayagwe wehile hagati yenu wawateweza wanhu iwokala kudibuga walonga, ‘Tucholeni tukaitambikile imilungu iyagwe,’ imilungu ayo hamuijuwile bule, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>avo sepenisepeni na muuze uze vinogile ng'hani, na kamba kweli mbuli ayo ihile itendigwa hagati yenu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>avo wakomeni kwa misime iwanhu iwokala kudibuga dijo, na dinangeni buga dijo na zikomeni fugo zao zose kwa misime. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>Muvilundize hamoja ivinhu vose vimusolile, na muvike kulubuga lwa dibuga na mvisome moto hamoja na dibuga kamba nhosa ya kusoma moto kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Buga dijo dokuwa vihame siku zose, na hodizengwa kabili. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Sikumusole kinhu chochose kilavigwe ili kisomigwe moto, ili Mndewa Imulungu yaleke kuwagevuzikila ng'hani. Kowatendela ganogile na kowonela bazi na kowatenda muwe wengi ng'hani kamba viyaiduwile kwa wahenga zenu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>kamba mwahamtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na kugoga malagizo gake gose goniwagwaa lelo na kutenda ganogile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s">Sikumuiyalale kamba viwoiyalala wanhu wa isi ziyagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>“Mweye mwa wana wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, avo sikumuichanje hebu kubea mapala genu mbuli ya kumulilila munhu yafile. <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>Mweye mwa wanhu ong'ala kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na Mndewa Imulungu kawasagula mweye muwe wanhu zake mna iwanhu wose okala mwiisi yose.<verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanyama odigwa na hawadigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Walawi 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>“Sikumuje kinhu chochose kigevuza. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Modaha kuja wanyama wano, ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na mbuzi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>ng'hogoni na swala na nyumbu na funo na mhala na nhelembo na ng'hondolo luwala, <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>na kila mnyama yeli na mibang'ho itulike na koselula, mnyama ayo diyeni. <verse eid="DEU 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Lakini sikumuje mnyama yoyose mibang'ho yake haitulike na haselula. Sikumuje ngamiya na buga na ndezi, awo oselula lakini mibang'ho yao haitulike, avo awo wafita kumwenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Vivija sikumuje nguluwe, kwavija hamoja mibang'ho yake itulika lakini haselula bule, wanyama awo wafita kumwenu, sikumuje nyama yao hebu kukwasa imitufi yao.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>“Modaha kuja kila aina ya somba weli na minzaka nzaka na makalabamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Lakini kiumbe chochose kikala mgamazi na chabule minzaka nzaka hebu makalabamba sikumuje, awo wose wafita kumwenu.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>“Modaha kuja ndege wose wang'alile. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Lakini ndege wano sikumuje, mhungu na jola na kimhanga, <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>kidumule na makungule na ndege wose wayagwe waigalile na hewo, <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>na ndege wose waigalile na bondwa, <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>mbuni na kilopo na vimhanga wayagwe, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>bundi na bundi mkulu na bundi mzelu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>bundi luwala na kinyang'huwi na mumbi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>lawalawa na aina zose za nyamkuta, lugawa na gombalima. <verse eid="DEU 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Na wang'onyo wose weli na mabawa wafita kumwenu, sikumuje. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Lakini wang'onyo weli na mabawa wang'alile modaha kuwaja.<verse eid="DEU 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>“Sikumuje ng'hone, modaha kumgwaa munhu baki iyokala kudibuga jenu yaje, hebu modaha kumuuzila munhu wa isi iyagwe, kwavija mweye mung'ala kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Sikuuteleke nyama ya mwana mbuzi mna gamaziwa ga mamake.<verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya mafungu ga longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>“Laveni fungu da longo da ndiya yenu yose yumsenga mmigunda kila mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Abaho gendeni hanhu aho hayasagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwika twaga jake, na baho kuulongozi wake mugaje mafungu ga longo ga ndiya yenu na ga divai yenu na gamavuta genu na ga wana wa chaudele wa ng'ombe zenu na ng'hondolo zenu, tendeni vino ili muifunze kumtegeleze Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu siku zose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>Kamba ako kumukala kutali na hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu hayasagule kwika twaga jake, avo hamudaha kupapa fungu da longo da ndiya yenu iyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>Avo uzeni ndiya yenu, na soleni zisente mbaka hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu hayasagule. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>Na mzisang'hanile sente azo kwa kugula kinhu chochose kimulonda, nyama ya ng'ombe na nyama ya ng'hondolo na divai hebu kinhu cha kung'wa, muvije na kudeng'helela aho kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu hamoja na wanhu wa mzing'anda zenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Sikumuwasemwe Walawi iwokala hagati yenu, kwavija awo wabule fungu hebu uhazi hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>“Na kila uhelelo wa mwaka wa kadatu laveni mafungu ga longo ga ndiya yenu yose na mugeke kamba ngama mna gamabuga genu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>Ago gokuwa mbuli ya Walawi kwavija wabule fungu hebu uhazi hagati yenu na mbuli ya wanhu baki na wana wakiwa na wagane iwokala mna gamabuga genu, hewo woja na kuwa wagima. Tendeni avo na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowatenda mumwede mna zisang'hano zenu zose za makono genu.<verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mwaka wa saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Walawi 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>“Kuuhelo wa kila mwaka wa saba molondigwa muleke kuwadai iwanhu madeni gao. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>Vino vivo vonda mutende, kila munhu yamkopeshe miyage, yafute deni dijo, na sikuyageze kumdai kwavija Mndewa Imulungu mwenyego kalonga deni dijo difutigwe. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Modaha kuwadai iwanhu baki, lakini madeni gose ga ndugu zenu mugafute.<verse eid="DEU 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatendela ganogile mwiisi iyowagwaa iwe yenu na kokuwa kuduhu hata munhu imoja hagati yenu yonda yawe mkiwa, <verse eid="DEU 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5"/>kamba mwahamtegeleza goya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kukweleleza malagizo gano goniwalagiza lelo. <verse eid="DEU 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowatenda mumwede kamba viyawalongele kotenda. Na mweye mowakopesha wanhu wa isi nyingi, lakini mweye hamukopa bule. Na vivija mowatawala wanhu wa isi nyingi, lakini iwanhu wa isi azo honda wawatawale mweye.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>“Kamba hagati yenu mweye hana ndugu yenu mkiwa, mna idibuga da isi ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iyowagwaa, sikumuwe wagila na sikumuleme kumtaza. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>Lakini laveni na mumkopeshe kinhu chochose kilondigwa kwa heyo. <verse eid="DEU 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>Muiteganye, sikumugelegeze vihile mmizoyo na kulonga, ‘Mwaka wa saba, umwaka wa kufuta madeni wammabehi,’ avo momgelegeza vihile ndugu yenu yeli mkiwa na hamumgwaa kinhu chochose, na heyo kodaha kumulilila Mndewa Imulungu mbuli yenu na mweye mokuwa na nzambi. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>Mgweeni ndugu yenu mkiwa kuno mizoyo yenu kwatu, na sikumuwe na lusikisiki, kwavija kwa mbuli ayo, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatendela ganogile mzisang'hano zenu zose na kwa kila kinhu kimtenda. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Kwavija wanhu wakiwa na waja welibule kinhu hawaswela bule mwiisi, avo nowalagiza muwe na moyo unogile kwa ndugu zenu welibule kinhu na waja weli wakiwa mwiisi yenu.<verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Viilondigwa kuwatendela watumwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 2:1-11">Kulawa 2:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>“Kamba ndugu yako Muebulania, mbigalo hebu mtwanzi, yahauzigwa kumwako, yakusang'hanile kwa miyaka sita, lakini muumwaka wa saba umuleke yasegele. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Na vonda umuleke yasegele, sikuumuleke yasegele makono gaiyeka. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>Umgwee kwa moyo unogile kwa gaja Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako gayakutendele umwede, ng'hondolo na ndiya na divai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Kumbukeni kamba mweye mukala watumwa ako mwiisi ya Misili na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kawagombola, lekaavo lelo nowalagiza vivo.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>“Lakini yahakulongela, ‘Sisegela kumwako,’ kwavija kokunogela gweye na iwanhu wa mng'anda yako na kolonda kukala na gweye, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>avo sola sanziya na utobole gwiti jake mbaka ayo isanziya ihome umulango na heyo kokuwa mtumwa wako siku zose. Vivija utende vivo kwa mtumwa wako wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="DEU 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Vivija sikuukone vidala kumulekesa mtumwa wako, kwavija kakusang'hanila kwa kipindi cha miyaka sita na kalihigwa nusu ya sente iyolihigwa kibaluwa. Tenda vivo na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kokutendela ganogile kwa kila kinhu kiutenda.<verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa chaudele wa ng'ombe na ng'hondolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>“Mulavile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako wana chaudele wose wa kimbigalo wa fugo yako ya ng'ombe na ng'hondolo. Sikuuwasang'hanile ng'ombe awo na sikuuikanhe imibahila ya ng'hondolo awo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Kila mwaka, gweye na wanhu wa mng'anda mmwako moja nyama ya wanyama awo kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hanhu aho honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Lakini kamba mnyama ayo kana kilema chochose, kamba msuwameso hebu magulu gake galemala hebu kana kinhu chochose mulukuli, sikuumulave nhosa kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Mnyama kamba ayo modaha kumuja kuko kudibuga jako, vivija wanhu wose ong'ala na wafitile odaha kumuja kamba viwajaga mhala hebu swala, <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>lakini sikumuje damu yake, ila muite hasi kamba mazi.<verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s">Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kulawa 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>“Muugoge mwezi wa Abibu na mudeng'helele Pasaka ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Kwavija muumwezi awo wa Abibu, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kawalava mwiisi ya Misili ikilo. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>Mmulavile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu nhosa ya Pasaka kulawa mzifugo zenu za ng'hondolo hebu ng'ombe, hanhu aho honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu kwika twaga jake. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>Sikumuje nhosa ayo hamoja na magate gageligwe hamila. Kwa kipindi cha siku saba dieni magate hagageligwe hamila, magate gago kolagusa kugaya, kwavija musegela mwiisi ya Misili himahima, avo kipindi chose chonda mukale moikumbuka siku ayo yumusegele mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Kwa kipindi acho cha siku saba munhu yoyose mwiisi yenu sikuyeke hamila mng'anda yake, na inyama ya mnyama yachinjigwe ichungulo ya siku ya ichanduso sikuisigale mbaka imitondo.<verse eid="DEU 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>“Sikumulave nhosa ya Pasaka kudibuga jojose dimulonda mweye mna gamabuga gonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>lakini muilavile hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu honda yahasagule kwika twaga jake, aho mulave nhosa ya Pasaka ichungulo, saa iija yumusegele mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>Nyama ayo muiteleke na muidile hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu honda yahasagule, na imitondo mubwele mna ivibanda venu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Kwa siku sita muje magate hagageligwe hamila, na kudisiku da saba mutende mting'hano mkulu wa kumtambikila Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na sikumsang'hane sang'hano yoyose kudisiku dijo.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyimwilinyimwili ya mawiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kulawa 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Walawi 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>“Peteni mawiki saba, tangu vimusonga kusenga indiya. <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>Abaho mutende nyimwilinyimwili ya Mawiki mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa kulava nhosa yumulonda, na mulave kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, viyawatendile mumwede. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Mudeng'helele kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mweye hamoja na wanenu wa kimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi, wasang'hanaji zenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi, Walawi na iwanhu baki na iwana wakiwa na wagane iwokala hamoja na mweye. Tendeni gago hanhu aho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu honda yahasagule kwika twaga jake. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Kumbukeni kamba mukala watumwa ako Misili, avo iteganyeni mugagoge mafundizo gano.<verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyimwilinyimwili ya Vibanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Walawi 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Kupetigwa 29:12-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>“Mwahamambukiza kubiga ndiya yenu na kukama zabibu zenu, tendeni nyimwilinyimwili ya Vibanda kwa kipindi cha siku saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Muideng'helele nyimwilinyimwili ayo, mweye na wanenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi, wasang'hanaji zenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi na Walawi na iwanhu baki na iwana wakiwa na wagane iwokala hamoja na mweye mna gamabuga genu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>Kwa siku saba mumtendele nyimwilinyimwili Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hanhu aho honda yahasagule, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatendela ganogile mna indiya yenu yose na mna zisang'hano zenu zose, na mweye modeng'helela.<verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>“Wambigalo wose wa isi yenu waiting'hane kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, miyanza midatu kila mwaka, hanhu aho honda yahasagule. Waiting'hane kipindi cha nyimwilinyimwili ya magate hagageligwe hamila, na nyimwilinyimwili ya mawiki na nyimwilinyimwili ya vibanda. Sikuwachole kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu makono gaiyeka. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Kila munhu yalave kamba viyodaha kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyamtendile yamwede.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Haki za iwanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>“Musagule wasemi na vilongozi kulawa mna gamakabila genu mna gamabuga gonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na hewo wawataguse iwanhu kamba viilondigwa. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Sikumuihinduse haki, sikumubagule na sikumutogole kubokela hongo kwavija hongo dotula meso ga wanhu weli na nzewele na kuhindusa kitala cha munhu yanogile. <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Mutende haki na muikweleleze, ili mudahe kukala na kuisola isi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>“Sikumusimike imhanda ya kutambikila imilungu Ashela behi na upango wa nhosa onda mumzengele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>Na sikumusimike mibwe ya kutambikila. Kinhu acho chomgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="s">Kutambika kugomesigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>“Sikummulavile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, nhosa ya ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo yali na kilema, kwavija mbuli ayo yomgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>“Kamba mwahahulika kudibuga dimoja mna gamabuga goyowagwelela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kamba hana mbigalo hebu mtwanzi kotenda gehile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kabena lagano jake, <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>na heyo kachola kuisang'hanila na kuitambikila imilungu iyagwe, kaditambikila zuwa hebu mbalamwezi hebu vinhu viyagwe vili kuulanga avo vinigomese sikumvitambikile, <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>na mweye mulongeligwa mbuli ayo na muihulika, avo muzahile kamba mbuli ayo ya ukweli. Kamba mbuli ayo ya ukweli na kamba kinhu acho kigevuza kitendigwa mwiisi ya Izilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>avo mulaveni munhu ayo kunze ya dibuga na mumtowe mabwe mbaka yafe. <verse eid="DEU 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Yakomigwe kwa usindila wa wanhu wabili hebu wadatu. Munhu sikuyakomigwe kwa usindila wa munhu imoja. <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Awo iwanhu olava usindila wasonge kumtowa munhu ayo kwa mabwe abaho wanhu wayagwe na hewo wamtowe kwa mabwe. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>“Kamba vahalawila vitala vidala na mweye hamujuwa va kutenda, vitala avo vodaha kuwa, mbuli ya ukomaji na mbuli ya haki ya wanhu na mbuli ya kuilumiza. Vahalawila vitala avo, musegele aho na muchole hanhu hayasagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>na kuko choleni kwa Walawi na imsemi yosang'hana kipindi acho, na mweye mulave avo ivitala na hewo otagusa. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>Avo, mutende kamba vonda wawalongele kulawa hanhu aho hayasagule Mndewa Imulungu, muiteganye mutende gose kamba vonda wawalagize. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>Musang'hane kamba viwowalongela na kamba viwowafunza. Sikumuleke mbuli yoyose iyowalagiza kutenda. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>Munhu yoleka kumtegeleza imulava nhosa yomsang'hanila Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hebu msemi, munhu ayo yakomigwe. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Wanhu wose ohulika na kudumba, na hawatenda kinhu bila kugelegeza.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya mndewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>“Mwahengila mwiisi yonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mwahaisola na kukala mumo, na mweye molonga, ‘Tusagule mndewa yatutawale, kamba wanhu wa isi zose zituzunguluke,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>modaha kumwika mndewa yawatawale, imunhu ayo yonda yamsagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. Momwika imoja wa ndugu zenu yawe mndewa kumwenu. Sikumumtende munhu baki, yeli siyo ndugu yenu yawe mndewa wenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>Hata avo sikuyawe na falasi wengi mbuli ya ng'hondo, na vivija sikuyawabweze iwanhu ako Misili ili yapate falasi wengi mbuli ya ng'hondo, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kawazuma, ‘Sikumubwele kuko kabili.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>Vivija sikuyasole watwanzi wengi, buleavo omtenda yamuleke Mndewa, na vivija sikuyawe na sente na zahabu nyingi. <verse eid="DEU 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>Vonda yakalile ikigoda cha undewa, yandike kitabu kwa kwiga ikitabu cha malagizo gano, kili mmakono ga iwalava nhosa, awo Iwalawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>Kitabu acho kokala nacho na yakisome siku zose za ugima wake ili yaifunze kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wake, na yagagoge malagizo gano na mafundizo gano, <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>na sikuyaikweze mwenyego kubanza ndugu zake na sikuyageke kutali na heyo malagizo gano kwa mbuli yoyose, ili yasigale muutawala siku nyingi heyo na ulelo wake mwiisi ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s">Fungu da iwalava nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>“Dikabila da Walawi, awo iwalava nhosa, sikuwawe na hanhu hebu uhazi wowose mwiisi ya Izilaeli. Hewo waje ndiya ilavagwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu kamba nhosa. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>Sikuwawe na uhazi hamoja na ndugu zao, Waizilaeli wayao, Mndewa Imulungu ayo uhazi wao kamba viyawalongele.<verse eid="DEU 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>“Dino dokuwa fungu da iwalava nhosa kulawa mzinhosa zilavigwa, iwe nhosa ya ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo, wamgwelele imulava nhosa umkono na zisaya na usapi. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Muwagwelele ndiya yenu ya ichanduso kusengigwa na divai na mavuta genu na mibahila ya ichanduso ya ng'hondolo zenu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Mna gamakabila genu gose, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawasagula iwanhu wa kabila da Lawi ili wamsang'hanile kamba walava nhosa siku zose.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>“Kamba Mulawi yoyose kolonda mwenyego kodaha kusegela kudibuga jojose da iwanhu wa Izilaeli na kuchola hanhu hayasagule Mndewa Imulungu, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>aho kodaha kusang'hana kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wake kamba awo iwalawi wayage osang'hana kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>Heyo yagweleligwa ndiya sawasawa na iwalava nhosa wayagwe, hamoja heyo kapata sente mbuli ya vinhu va iwahenga zake viuzigwe.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ozumigwa mbuli ya mila zigevuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>“Mwahengila mwiisi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu sikumukweleleze mila zigevuza za iwanhu wa isi azo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Sikukuwe munhu yoyose hagati yenu yonda yamulave nhosa muumoto mwanage wa kimbigalo hebu wa kitwanzi, hebu munhu yoyose yolagula hebu yolola nyota za wanhu hebu yofambula mbuli zikwiza hebu muhawi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>hebu munhu yologa wanhu hebu munhu yowanga hebu munhu youza mbuli kwa mizimu. <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Munhu yoyose yotenda mbuli kamba zizo komgevuza Mndewa Imulungu. Kwa mbuli kamba azo zigevuza, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowawinga iwanhu wa isi azo zili kuulongozi wenu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>Molondigwa mutelele mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mtula ndagu yaigalile na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>“Wanhu wa isi azo zonda musole isi yao owategeleza iwanhu olola nyota za iwanhu na walaguzi, lakini Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowagomesa mweye sikumutende vivo.<verse eid="DEU 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu komwinulilani mtula ndagu kamba niye kulawa hagati yenu, Mwiizilaeli miyenu na mweye mumtegeleze heyo. <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Mbuli ayo iyo yumumpulile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ako Holebu siku dija vimuiting'hane, mulonga, ‘Sikutuihulike kabili sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, na sikutuwone kabili moto uno mkulu, buleavo tofa!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Na heyo Mndewa Imulungu kanongela, ‘Walonga goya. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>Nowenulila mtula ndagu kamba gweye, imoja wa ndugu zao. Niye nogela mbuli zangu mmulomo wake na heyo kowalongela gose gonda nimulagize. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yaleme mbuli zonda yalonge mtula ndagu ayo kwa twaga jangu, niye mwenyego nomkoboza. <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Lakini mtula ndagu yoyose yonda yalonge mbuli kwa twaga jangu, na kuno niye simulagize yalonge mbuli ayo hebu kolonga mbuli kwa twaga da imulungu iyagwe, mtula ndagu ayo kofa.’<verse eid="DEU 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>“Lakini mweye modaha kugelegeza mmizoyo yenu, ‘Todahaze kuijuwa mbuli hailongigwe na Mndewa Imulungu?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>Kamba mtula ndagu yahalonga mbuli kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu, na mbuli ayo hailawilile hebu siyo kweli, mbuli ayo hailongigwe na Mndewa Imulungu, avo mtula ndagu ayo kalonga kwa kuitapa, mweye sikumumdumbe.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s">Mabuga ga kukimbilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Kupetigwa 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yawakoboze iwanhu waja isi yao kowagwaa mweye, na mwahaisola na kukala mzing'anda zao, <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>mubagule mabuga madatu kulawa mwiisi ayo yonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu muisole. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>Mutende nzila za kubita na muigole miyanza midatu isi ayo yonda yawagwee Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu muisole ili munhu yoyose yomkoma munhu yakimbilile kuko.<verse eid="DEU 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>“Munhu yahamkoma munhu iyagwe bila kulonda na hawagombile na munhu ayo, kodaha kukimbilila kudibuga dimoja mna gamabuga gago, na kouhonya ugima wake. <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>Tulonge, munhu kochola na miyage kumuhulo kukanha ngodi na kipindi viyokanha zingodi umuhini usomoka na dishoka dimkoma miyage, munhu ayo kodaha kukimbilila kudibuga dimoja mna gamabuga gago, na kouhonya ugima wake. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Lakini kamba hana buga dimoja diiyeka, munhu ayo yoliha mbuli ya kugevuzika kodaha kumkweleleza na komgoga na kumkoma munhu ayo yamkomile miyage bila kulonda, hamoja halondigwe kukomigwa, kwavija wakala hawagombile bule. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>Avo niye nowalagiza mubagule mabuga madatu.<verse eid="DEU 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>“Vivija kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yahazongeza zimbaka za isi yenu kamba viyaiduwile kwa wahenga zenu, na kowagwaa isi yose iyalongile kowagwaa iwahenga zenu, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>na kamba mwahagoga goya malagizo gose goniwalagiza lelo, na mwahamnogela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kukweleleza nzila zake siku zose, avo mokwengeza mabuga gayagwe madatu mna igano madatu, <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>ili munhu habanange kinhu sikuyakomigwe mwiisi yenu iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, avo sikumoneke mubananga kwa kwita damu ya munhu.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>“Lakini kamba munhu kagomba na miyage, na heyo kamkweleleza kamvamila na kumkoma, abaho kakimbilila kudibuga dimoja mna gamabuga gago, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>avo iwavele wa buga dijo wawatume wanhu wakamsole munhu ayo na wamgale kwa imunhu yoliha ili yakomigwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Sikummonele bazi, lakini mosegesa gehile ga kumkoma munhu hatendile gehile mna iisi ya Izilaeli, ili mukale goya.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>“Sikumusegese vilaguso va zimbaka na waenu, zikigwe umwaka na iwahenga mwiisi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulava usindila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>“Usindila wa munhu imoja haulondigwa kumtagusa munhu mbuli ya kitala chochose. Usindila wa wanhu wabili hebu wadatu awo udaha kumtenda munhu yatagusigwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Kamba kolawilila munhu yoyose komtagusa miyage kwa kulava kitala cha uvizi, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>avo heyo na imunhu yotagusigwa wachole kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, na kuulongozi wa iwalava nhosa na iwasemi iwosang'hana kipindi acho. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>Awo iwasemi wakilole goya kitala acho na kamba imunhu ayo yalavile uusindila kaviza na kamtagusa miyage kwa uvizi, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>avo, momtendela kamba viyalondile kumtendela miyage. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Na wanhu wayagwe ohulika na kudumba, avo gehile kamba gago hagatendigwa kabili hagati yenu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Sikumuwonele bazi iwanhu kamba awo. Ugima kwa ugima na siso kwa siso na zino kwa zino na mkono kwa mkono na mgulu kwa mgulu.<verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya ng'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>“Mwahachola kuna ing'hondo kuitowa na iwanhu owehila, na mokona falasi na mituka, na wakalizi wengi kubanza mweye, sikumuwadumbe, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, yawalavile mwiisi ya Misili kokuwa hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Mung'hali hamnasonga kuitowa, imulava nhosa yalongole kuulongozi na yawalongele iwanhu, <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>‘Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli! Sambi mosonga kuitowa na iwanhu owehila. Sikumuwadumbe hebu kunyawanyawa hebu kugwaya kwa bwembwe, <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu ayo yochola hamoja na mweye kuitowa na iwanhu owehila mbuli yenu ili yawatende muhume.’<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>“Abaho ivilongozi wawalongele iwanhu, ‘Vino kuna munhu yoyose hano yazengile ng'anda ya sambi lakini yang'hali hana ilimbula? Yabwele ukae, sikuyafe kuna ing'hondo na munhu iyagwe yailimbule ing'anda ayo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Vino kuna munhu yoyose hano yahandile mizabibu na yang'hali hanagalimbula gamatunda? Yabwele ukae, sikuyafe kuna ing'hondo na munhu iyagwe yagalimbule. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Vino kuna mbigalo yoyose hano yamfungile zengele mtwanzi ili yawe mwehe wake? Yabwele ukae sikuyafe kuna ing'hondo na mbigalo iyagwe yamsole imtwanzi.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Vilongozi wagendelele kuwalongela iwanhu, ‘Vino kuna munhu yoyose hano konyawanyawa? Yabwele ukae sikuyawatende wayage wanyawenyawe kamba heyo.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Vilongozi wahamambukiza kulonga na iwanhu, wawasagule ivilongozi wa iwakalizi wawalongoze iwanhu.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>“Mwahalonda kudivamila buga, tanhu wagweleleni iwanhu nyafasi kamba odaha kulonga walemelwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Wenekae wa buga dijo wahalonda tindiwalo na kuilava kumwenu, aho wanhu wose wali mumo owasang'hanila na osang'hana kwa kunanahizigwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>Lakini wahalema kutenda tindiwalo na mweye ila oitowa ng'hondo na mweye, baho mudivamile buga jao. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kodigela mmakono genu na muwakome iwambigalo wose wali mumo, <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>lakini iwatwanzi na iwana na zifugo na vinhu vose vili kudibuga dijo, muvisole. Modaha kudeng'helela vinhu vija vimusolile va iwanhu owehila viyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Vino vivo vonda mutende kwa mabuga gose geli kutali na mweye, siyo mabuga ga isi imugweleligwa kuisola.<verse eid="DEU 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>“Lakini mna gamabuga ga isi ayo iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, sikumuleke kinhu chochose king'hali kigima. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>Muwakome iwanhu wose, Wahiti na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyawalagize, <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>buleavo, owafunza kukweleleza mila zao zigevuza ziwatendaga kwa imilungu yao, avo na mweye motenda nzambi kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>“Mwahadizunguluka buga kwa siku nyingi, na mwahadisola dibuga, sikumuinange imibiki ya matunda kwa kuikanha na shoka. Vino imibiki awo wanhu mbaka muibanange? Modaha kugaja matunda ga imibiki ayo lakini sikumuikanhe. <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Modaha kukanha mibiki ija iiyeka yumujuwa hailelaga matunda ili muzengele vilingo kipindi acho vimudizunguluka dibuga ili mudisole.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya ifa haijuwigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>“Munhu yahakomigwa kuluwala mna iisi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu na mweye hamujuwa nani yamkomile, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>iwavele na iwasemi wenu wachole kupima utali wa aho umtufi wa imunhu hauli mbaka wapate dibuga dili behi na mtufi awo. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>Abaho iwavele wa buga dili behi na uja umtufi wasole bofu da ng'ombe ding'hali hadisang'haniligwa sang'hano yoyose hebu kugeligwa nila. <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>Na hewo wamuhumuluse ing'ombe kubonde kuna ulwanda haunyalaga, na kubonde hadilimagwa hebu kuhandigwa, kuko wambene isingo. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Vivija iwalava nhosa wa kabila da Lawi olondigwa wawe baho. Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawasagula wamsang'hanile na wawatambikile iwanhu kwa twaga jake. Vivija hewo wagweleligwa udahi kwa mbuli yoyose na migomvi. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Ayo ing'ombe yahabenigwa isingo, iwavele wose wa buga dijo dili behi na umtufi wa munhu ayo yakomigwe, wanawe makono gao kwa mazi uchanha mwa ayo ing'ombe, <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>na walonge, ‘Hatumkomile bule imunhu ino na hatumjuwile bule imunhu yamkomile. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, uditogole loholo dino da iwanhu wako wa Izilaeli, awo uwagombole, sikuugelegeze gehile ga iwanhu wako wa Izilaeli, kwa ifa ya munhu yelibule kitala, lakini ugele kumgongo.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Avo, mwahatenda viyolonda Mndewa Imulungu mokuwa mduhu kitala cha ifa ya munhu ayo.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Watwanzi wafungwa kulawa kuna ing'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>“Mwahachola kuna ing'hondo kuitowa na iwanhu owehila, na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawatenda muhume, na muwasola iwanhu awo kuno wang'hali wagima, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>na kamba imoja wenu komona mtwanzi yanogile mna iwanhu awo wamuwasolile na kolonda kumsola yawe mwehe wake, <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>avo ayo imbigalo yamsole na yamgale ukae kumwake, na yambee dipala na yamwengule zing'hombe, <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>na yasaule iviwalo viyezile navo. Yakale kwa mwezi mgima yamulilile tatake na mamake. Abaho kodaha kumsola, kokuwa mwehe wako na gweye mbigalo wake. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Kamba ako kumwande humulonda bule, muleke yachole kuyolonda, sikuumuuze, na sikuumtende mtumwa kwavija kumnanga.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana chaudele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>“Kamba mbigalo imoja kana wehe wabili na komnogela imoja kubanza iyagwe. Na iwatwanzi awo wamulelela wana wa kimbigalo, na mwana chaudele kaleligwa na ayo imtwanzi hamnogela, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>yahavika siku ya kuwagwaa awo iwana uhazi, ayo itata munhu halondigwa bule kumtenda ija imwana wa mwehe yomnogela kamba ayo imwana wa chaudele na kumuleka ija imwana wa imtwanzi hamnogela yeli imwana wa chaudele. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>Kolondigwa yamtogole ija imwana wa chaudele, imwana wa ija imtwanzi hamnogela, na yamgwee kija kilondigwa, miyanza mibili ya vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana mdulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>“Kamba munhu kana mwana mdulu na mtundu, hamtegeleza tatake hebu mamake hata kamba yahachapigwa, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>avo, tata munhu na mama munhu wamgoge mwana ayo na wamgale kwa iwavele kumulango wa buga. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>Tata na mama wa mwana ayo wawalongele iwavele wa dibuga, ‘Mwanetu mdulu na mtundu, halonda kututegeleza, mmelo na mlevi.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>Baho iwanhu wa buga dijo wamtowe mabwe mwana ayo mbaka yafe. Avo kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu. Kila munhu mwiisi ya Izilaeli kuihulika mbuli ayo na kodumba.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo gayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>“Kamba munhu katenda kitala kilondigwa yakomigwe na kakomigwa na umtufi utumbikigwa mdibiki, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>mtufi wake sikuulekigwe mdibiki kilo kigima, lakini muuzike siku didijo. Kwavija munhu yawambigwe mdibiki kaduwiligwa na Mndewa Imulungu na mweye hamulondigwa kuifitiza isi yonda yawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, iwe yenu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo gayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>“Wahamona ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo wa Mwiizilaeli miyago kapotela, sikuumuleke, lakini umbweze kumwake. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>Lakini kamba ayo imwenyego kokala kutali hebu hujuwa bule mwenyego nani, avo uchole nayo ukae kumwako na ukale nayo mbaka mwenyego vonda yeze kumzahila, na gweye umgwelele. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>Utende vivo kwa kihongwe hebu kiwalo hebu kinhu chochose kiyagize Mwiizilaeli miyago na gweye kuchona. Sikuukileke.<verse eid="DEU 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>“Wahamona kihongwe hebu ng'ombe wa Mwiizilaeli miyago kagwa mnzila, sikuumuleke. Kolondigwa umtaze kumwinula.<verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>“Watwanzi sikuwavale viwalo va wambigalo, na wambigalo sikuwavale viwalo va watwanzi. Munhu yotenda vivo komgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>“Wahavika mvulu ya ndege mdibiki hebu mnzila, ina makinda hebu mafinga na mama munhu kagawasila gago gamakinda hebu gamafinga, sikuumsole mama munhu na makinda gake. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Muleke mama munhu yachole, lakini kodaha kugasola gamakinda. Wahatenda vivo mbuli zako zokugendela goya na kokala siku nyingi.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>“Wahazenga ng'anda ili na gati da uchanha, uzenge senyenge kuzunguluka ikiswili, sikugakupate gehile mbuli ya kwita damu kamba munhu yahapatuka kulawa kuko na kufa.<verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>“Sikuuhande mizabibu yako hamoja na minoga iyagwe, buleavo ndiya yose yofita, si gaja gaiyeka gauhandile lakini vivija na gamatunda ga mizabibu.<verse eid="DEU 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>“Sikuulime mgunda kwa kutumia ng'ombe na kihongwe hamoja.<verse eid="DEU 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>“Sikuuvale kiwalo kitendigwe kwa sufi na kitani hamoja.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>“Funga vikumbi mna zimhembe nne za kiwalo chako.<verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya mbigalo na mtwanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>“Kamba mbigalo kosola mtwanzi, na vonda yamuwase komwihila, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>na komdeta na komulonga vihile kamba viyamsolile hakalile mhambe. <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>Avo, tata na mama wa mtwanzi ayo wagale uusindila kwa iwavele hana ulwivi lwa dibuga kulagusa kamba mtwanzi ayo kakala mhambe. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>Tatake yalonge, ‘Nimgwaa munhu ino mndele wangu yamsole na vino sambi komwihila, <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>na komulonga vihile kamba hamvikile mhambe buleavo usindila wa heyo kamba kalala mhambe auno hano.’ Abaho yakikunzule ikikumbi kikalile na awo uusindila kuulongozi wa iwavele wa dibuga. <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>Baho awo iwavele wa dibuga wamgale ayo imbigalo na wamzabule mbalati. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>Abaho wamtoze mbigalo ayo vihande gana dimoja va shaba na wamgwee tata wa mtwanzi ayo, kwavija mbigalo ayo kamgela kinyala mndele wa Kiizilaeli. Na mtwanzi ayo kogendelela kuwa mwehe wake, na hadaha kumwasa siku zose za ugima wake. <verse eid="DEU 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Lakini kamba gago goyolonga gaukweli na haduhu usindila ulagusa kamba heyo kakala mhambe, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>wamgale mtwanzi ayo hana ulwivi lwa ing'anda ya tatake na wambigalo wa buga dijo wamtowe mabwe mbaka yafe, kwavija katenda gehile mwiisi ya Izilaeli kwa kutenda ugoni yang'hali mng'anda ya tatake. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>“Mbigalo yahagogigwa ugoni na mwehe wa munhu iyagwe, wose wabili, imbigalo na imtwanzi wakomigwe. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>“Mbigalo yahamvika mndele yalaviligwe vilama kudibuga na komuwasa, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>wose wabili muwalave kunze ya dibuga na muwatowe mabwe mbaka wafe. Mndele ayo yakomigwe kwavija hagutile bule ili yatazigwe hamoja kakala kudibuga, na ayo imbigalo yakomigwe kwavija kamnanga mtwanzi yalaviligwe vilama. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>“Lakini kamba mbigalo kaiting'hana na mtwanzi yalaviligwe vilama kunze ya dibuga na komuwasa kwa nguvu, heyo imbigalo yaiyeka yakomigwe, <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>na ayo imtwanzi mmuleke heyo hatendile gehile gakumtenda yakomigwe. Mbuli ino kamba ya munhu kumtowa miyage na kumkoma, <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>kwavija mbigalo ayo kamgoga kwa nguvu ayo imtwanzi ako kunze ya dibuga, na hamoja kaguta nyangi yatazigwe kukala kuduhu munhu wa kumtaza.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>“Mbigalo yahamting'hana mtwanzi hanalaviligwa vilama na yahamuwasa kwa nguvu, na wahagogigwa, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>mbigalo ayo yamulihe tata wa mtwanzi ayo vihande malongo matano va shaba kwavija kamnanga mtwanzi ayo, na mtwanzi ayo yawe mwehe wake, na honda yamuleke siku zose za ugima wake.<verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30"/>“Mbigalo yoyose sikuyawase na mwehe wa tatake, yahatenda vivo komgela kinyala tatake.<verse eid="DEU 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wagomesigwe kwingila mumting'hano wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>“Mbigalo yoyose yahondigwe zimhumbu hebu yakanhigwe kimbigalo sikuyengile mumting'hano wa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>“Mwana halamu yoyose hebu ulelo wake mbaka ulelo wa longo sikuyengile mumting'hano wa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>“Muamoni hebu Mmoabu yoyose na ulelo wao mbaka ulelo wa longo sikuwengile mumting'hano wa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu, <verse eid="DEU 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>kwavija walema kuwagwelela ndiya na mazi vimukalile mnzila molawa Misili, na wamgwaa kibaluwa Balaamu mwanage Beoli kulawa Petoli ako Mesopotamia yeze yawaduwile mweye. <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu hamtegeleze bule Balaamu ila kagimbula gamakungu gawa kinhu kinogile, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawanogela. <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>Avo, sikumuilumbe na hewo hebu kuwatenda wamwede siku zose zonda mukale.<verse eid="DEU 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>“Sikumuwehile Waedomu kwavija hewo ndugu zenu, na sikumuwehile Wamisili kwavija mukala mwiisi yao kamba wanhu baki. <verse eid="DEU 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Ulelo wao kusongela wa kadatu odaha kwingila mumting'hano wa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mbuli ya kufita mna ing'hambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>“Mwahachola kuna ing'hondo na kukala mwiing'hambi, kila munhu yaiteganye na kinhu chochose kifitile. <verse eid="DEU 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Kamba hagati yenu hana munhu yoyose kafita kwavija ikilo chelesi kimulawa, munhu ayo yalawe kunze ya ing'hambi. Sikuyengile kabili, <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>lakini yahavika ichungulo yakoge, na zuwa dahengila kodaha kubwela kuna ing'hambi.<verse eid="DEU 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>“Muwe na hanhu kunze ya ing'hambi honda mucholege kucholo. <verse eid="DEU 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Mna ivinhu venu molondigwa muwe na magembe, mwahachola kucholo, muhimbe simo na mufukile mavi genu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Ng'hambi yenu yolondigwa ing'ale, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kokwiza hagati yenu ili yawakombole na yawagele mmakono genu iwanhu owehila. Avo sikumutende yachone kinhu kifitile hagati yenu, buleavo kowaleka.<verse eid="DEU 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo gayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>“Sikuumbweze kwa mkulu wake mtumwa yamkimbile mkulu wake na kwiza kumwako. <verse eid="DEU 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>Muleke yakale hamoja na gweye hanhu aho honda yahasagule, na gweye sikuumonele.<verse eid="DEU 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>“Mwiizilaeli yoyose mbigalo hebu mtwanzi sikuyatende ugoni mzing'anda za imilungu iyagwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>Vivija sente yoyose munhu yaipatile kwa ugoni sikuyaigale kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa kulonda kuliha kija kiyaiduwile, kwavija mbigalo hebu mtwanzi yotenda ugoni kamba awo, komgevuza Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>“Sikuumkopeshe Mwiizilaeli miyago kinhu na ulonde yakubwezele na nyongeza, iwe sente hebu ndiya hebu kinhu chochose kikopeshigwa na kubwezigwa na nyongeza. <verse eid="DEU 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Kodaha kumkopesha munhu baki na kokubwezela na nyongeza, lakini Mwiizilaeli miyago sikuulonde yakubwezele na nyongeza, na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kokutenda umwede mzisang'hano zako zose zonda usang'hane mwiisi imuchola kuisola.<verse eid="DEU 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>“Wahaiduwila kinhu kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, sikuukawe kukivikiza, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kokilonda kulawa kumwako, na gweye kokuwa na nzambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>Lakini wahaleka kuiduwila, hutenda nzambi bule. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Uiteganye kolondigwa ugavikize gaja gose gauiduwile kwa mulomo wako, kwavija kumulongela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kwa kulonda mwenyego.<verse eid="DEU 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>“Wahabita mumgunda wa mizabibu wa miyago, kodaha kubawa zabibu na kuzija vija viudaha, lakini sikuubawe na kwika mkigelo chako. <verse eid="DEU 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>Wahabita mumgunda wa ngano wa miyago kodaha kuhulula na kufigisa na kuja, lakini sikuusole isengo na kusenga ingano.<verse eid="DEU 23:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="s">Nyasa na kusola kabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>“Kamba mbigalo yahasola mtwanzi na abaho ako kumwande komwihila kwavija kona kinhu hakimnogela kumwake, avo mbigalo ayo yahamgwaa kibua cha nyasa, na komuwinga yasegele ukae kumwake, <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>na mtwanzi ayo yahasoligwa na mbigalo iyagwe, <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>na mbigalo ayo wa kabili vivija komwihila na komgwaa kibua cha nyasa mtwanzi ayo na komuwinga yasegele ukae kumwake hebu mbigalo ayo yamsolile yahafa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>avo ayo mbigalo wa ichanduso halondigwa yamsole kabili mtwanzi ayo kwavija kafitizigwa. Avo sikumugale gehile mwiisi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo gayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>“Mbigalo yahasola mwehe sambi sambi sikuyachole kuna ing'hondo na sikuyagweleligwe sang'hano yoyose, yalekigwe yabwihile mwaka mgima, ili yakale ukae kumwake na yadeng'helele na mwehe wake.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>“Munhu yoyose sikuyabokele dibwe da uchanha hebu da hasi da kudugila kamba lahani, wahatenda vivo kamba kosola ugima wa munhu ayo.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>“Munhu yoyose yahamwiba Mwiizilaeli miyage na kumtenda mtumwa wake hebu komchuuza muutumwa, munhu ayo kolondigwa yakomigwe. Kwa nzila ayo mogasegesa gehile hagati yenu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>“Kamba munhu yahawa na utamu wa dikulu molondigwa mugagoge goya malagizo ga Iwalawi. Kamba viniwalagize hewo vivo vonda mukweleleze goya. <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Kumbukeni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyamtendele Miliamu vimukalile mmwanza kulawa Misili.<verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>“Wahamkopesha kinhu miyago, sikuwingile mng'anda yake kusola lahani. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Wime kunze na umuleke imunhu yuumdai yakugalile mwenyego ayo ilehani. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>Kamba munhu ayo mkiwa na lahani yake mgolole, sikuukale nao kilo kigima. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>Umbwezele mgolole wake kila siku ichungulo ili yaigubike. Na heyo kokupulila umwede, na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kokona kunoga mgameso gake.<verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>“Sikuumbunze kibaluwa wako yeli mkiwa na ngaengae, yawe Mwiizilaeli miyago hebu munhu baki iyokala kuna gamabuga genu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>Kila siku, zuwa hadinakwingila umlihe fungu jake da sang'hano ya siku ayo, kwavija heyo mkiwa na kobeta kinhu acho, buleavo komulilila Mndewa Imulungu na gweye kokuwa na nzambi.<verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>“Tata na mama sikuwakomigwe kwa gehile ga wanao, vivija wana sikuwakomigwe kwa gehile ga tata zao na mama zao. Kila munhu yakomigwe kwa gehile gake mwenyego.<verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>“Sikumuihinduse haki ya iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa. Sikumusole kiwalo cha mgane na kukika lahani. <verse eid="DEU 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>Kumbukeni kamba mweye mukala watumwa mwiisi ya Misili, na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawagombola kulawa kuko, lekaavo nowagwaa lagizo dijo.<verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>“Mwahasenga mmigunda yenu na kuisemwa viyagwe sikumubwele kukisogo kusalata vija visigale, lakini muwalekele iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa na wagane, ili Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu yawatendele ganogile mzisang'hano zenu zose. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>Mwahatigisa mizeituni yenu kipindi cha kubawa, sikumubwelele kutigisa kabili ila muwalekele iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa na wagane. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>Mwahabawa zabibu, sikumubwele kukisogo kubawa zabibu zisigale ila muwalekele iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa na wagane. <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>Kumbukeni kamba mweye mukala watumwa mwiisi ya Misili. Lekaavo nowagwaa lagizo dino.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>“Wanhu wabili wahagomba na wahachola kuna ikitala kulamuligwa, imoja yahakoneka hatendile dihile na iyagwe yahakoneka kabananga, <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>na kamba ija yabanange kolondigwa yazabuligwe mbalati, msemi yamulagize munhu ayo yawase hasi kingubanguba na yazabuligwe mbalati kamba vija viyabanange. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>Munhu yabanange kinhu kodaha kuzabuligwa mbalati malongo mane, lakini siyo kubanza vivo, mwahongeza kubanza vivo momgela kinyala Mwiizilaeli miyenu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>“Sikuumfunge ng'ombe umulomo wahamsang'hanila kubiga uhemba.<verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndugu wa mwenekwaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>“Kamba ndugu wabili okala hanhu na imoja wao yahafa bila kuleka mwana wa kimbigalo, mtwanzi wa mwenekwaga sikuyasoligwe na munhu baki kunze ya ulukolo lwa mwenekwaga. Ndugu wa mwenekwaga kolondigwa yamsole mgane ayo. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>Mwana wa ichanduso wa kimbigalo yonda yaleligwe kopetigwa kamba mwana wa mwenekwaga, ili twaga jake sikudisemwigwe mwiisi ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Lakini kamba ndugu ayo wa mwenekwaga hamulonda ayo imtwanzi mgane, avo mtwanzi ayo yachole kuulongozi wa iwavele wa dibuga na yalonge, ‘Ndugu wa mkasano wangu yafile kolema kugendeleza twaga da ndugu yake yafile mwiisi ya Izilaeli, avo kolema kutenda gaja golondigwa heyo yagatende kamba ndugu wa mwenekwaga.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Abaho awo iwavele wamkeme ayo imbigalo na walonge na heyo. Kamba kogendelela kulema kumsola, <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>mtwanzi ayo mgane yamgendele mbigalo ayo mgameso ga iwavele wa dibuga, yamvule kilatu chake kimoja na yamtemele mate mkihanga na yamulongele, ‘Vino vivo viilondigwa kutendeligwa imunhu yolema kugendeleza ulelo kwa ndugu yake.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>Na twaga da ng'anda yake mwiisi ya Izilaeli dokuwa, ‘Ng'anda ya munhu yavuligwe kilatu.’”<verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo gayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>“Wambigalo wabili wahaitowa na mwehe wa imoja kogeza kumtaza mkasano wake kwa kumgoga gamaungo gamadeke ija yoitowa na mkasano wake, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>avo muukanhe mkono wa mtwanzi ayo na sikummonele bazi.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>“Sikumuwe na vinhu vibili vibili va kupimila vinhu, kimoja kizama kiyagwe kibewe. Sikumtumie vipimo vivizaga. <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>Sikumuwe na vinhu va aina mbili va kupimila, kikulu na kidodo. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>Mupimile vinhu vinogile va kupimila ili mukale siku nyingi mwiisi imugweleligwa na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Wanhu otenda vinhu kamba vivo, wose otenda kwa uvizi, omgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga kuwakoma Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>“Kumbukeni gawawatendele Waamaleki vimukalile mmwanza kulawa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>Kumbukeni viwawatowile vimukalile mnzila na kuwakoma wose wadonhile wakalile kukisogo chenu. Waamaleki hawamdumbile Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Avo, kipindi Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu vonda yawahumuze na magazo ga wanhu wose owehila, awo owazunguluka mwiisi iyowagwaa mukale mumo, sikumuisemwe molondigwa muwakome Waamaleki wose.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s">Gaja gaichanduso kusengigwa na fungu da longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>“Wahavika na kuisola isi iyokugwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>usole ndiya yonda usonge kusenga kulawa mwiisi iyokugwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, uike mkigelo na ugale hanhu aho honda yahasagule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako kwika twaga jake. <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>Umcholele mulava nhosa yosang'hana kipindi acho, na umulongele, ‘Lelo notogola mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu kamba ningila mwiisi iyaiduwile kwa wahenga zetu kamba kotugwelela.’<verse eid="DEU 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>“Na mulava nhosa vonda yasole kigelo acho mmakono gako na kukika kuulongozi wa upango wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>ulonge mbuli zino kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, ‘Muhenga wangu kakala Mwalamu, kagunga kuno na kuno abaho kachola ako Misili na kakala kuko kamba munhu baki. Wakala wanhu wadodo viwakalile kuko, lakini wawa wanhu wa isi ng'hulu na wengi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Wamisili watutendela usede watugaza na watunanahiza tusang'hane sang'hano ndala za utumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>Abaho tumulilila Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zetu, kahulika kililo chetu na kagona magazo getu na sang'hano ndala na gose gehile gatupatile. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu katulava kuko Misili kwa mkono wake wa nguvu, kwa vinhu vidumbiza na vilaguso na unzonza. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>Katugala hano na katugwelela isi ino imemile maziwa na uki. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Na sambi nimgalila Mndewa Imulungu ndiya ino ya ichanduso kulawa mwiisi iyanigwelele.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Abaho wike hasi ikigelo, kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, na uidulike umtambikile kuulongozi wake. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Na gweye udeng'helele ganogile gose gayakutendele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, gweye na Iwalawi na iwanhu baki na ndugu zako wadeng'helele hamoja na gweye.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>“Kila miyaka midatu, kila imoja wenu yalave fungu da longo da ndiya yake yose mbuli ya Walawi na iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa na wagane, ili wapate ndiya ya kuja na kwiguta viwokala mmabuga genu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Abaho ulonge vino kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wako, ‘Nidilava mng'anda yangu fungu ding'ala, niwagwaa Walawi na iwanhu baki na iwana iwakiwa na wagane, kamba viundagize nitende. Sibenile lagizo jako hebu kuisemwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Sidile fungu jojose da longo ving'halile noiyalala, sidilavile kunze ya ng'anda yangu ving'halile nifita na sidilavile fungu da longo kwa iwanhu wafile. Nikutegeleza gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu, na nitenda kila kinhu kiunilagize. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>Ulole hasi kulawa hanhu hako hong'ala ako kuulanga, uwatendele ganogile wanhu zako Izilaeli na isi yuutugwelele kamba viuiduwile kwa iwahenga zetu, isi imemile maziwa na uki.’<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>“Lelo didino Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowalagiza mugagoge mafundizo na malagizo gano. Muiteganye mugagoge kwa mizoyo yose na kwa loho yose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>Lelo mulonga kamba Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu wenu, na kamba mokweleleza nzila zake na kugoga mafundizo gake na malagizo na momtegeleza. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Na Mndewa Imulungu lelo kalonga kamba mweye mwa wanhu zake heyo mwenyego kamba viyaiduwile na kamba molondigwa mugagoge malagizo gake gose. <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatenda mweye muwe wanhu wa isi ng'hulu kubanza isi zose ziyalumbile, mbuli ya twaga jake na nhogolwa zake na ukulu wake. Na mweye mokuwa wanhu zake wang'alile kamba viyalongile.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga Imulungu gandikigwe mna imibwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Abaho Musa na iwavele wa Izilaeli kawalongela iwanhu, “Mugagoge malagizo gose goniwalagiza lelo. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Siku dijo mwahaloka lwanda lwa Yolidani na kwingila mwiisi iyalongile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowagwaa, musimike mibwe mikulu na muikuluge kwa ulongo mzelu. <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Mgandike malagizo gano gose mgamabwe gago, mwahengila mwiisi iyowagwaa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, isi imemile maziwa na uki kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu viyawalongele iwahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Mwahaloka umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani isimikeni mibwe ayo kulugongo lwa Ebali kamba viniwalagiza lelo na muikuluge kwa ulongo mzelu. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>Mumzengele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu upango wa nhosa kwa mabwe hagasongoligwe. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>Ona, upango wowose onda mumzengele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu uzengigwe kwa mabwe hagasongoligwe. Uchanha ya upango awo mmulavile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu nhosa za kusoma moto. <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Mmulavile nhosa za kugala kuilumba, na mudile aho na kudeng'helela kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>Mugandike goya uchanha ya mibwe ayo malagizo gano gose.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Avo Musa na Iwalawi, iwalava nhosa kawalongela iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli, “Nyamaleni mnitegeleze mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli. Lelo didino mweye muwa wanhu wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Avo, mumtegeleze Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na mugagoge malagizo gake na mafundizo gake goniwalagiza lelo.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makungu ga kuleka kutegeleza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>Siku ayo Musa kawalagiza iwanhu kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>“Mwahaloka ulwanda lwa Yolidani makabila gano geme kulugongo lwa Gelizimu kipindi mbuli za kutambika vizilongigwa, Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Na makabila gano geme kulugongo lwa Ebali kipindi makungu vigolongigwa. Lubeni na Gadi na Asheli na Zabuloni na Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>Na Iwalawi walonge kwa sauti ng'hulu kwa iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli,<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yosongola kinyago hebu yolumbula zuma kwa moto na kutenda kinyago, kinhu kitendigwe kwa makono ga fundi na kukitambikila kinyelegezi kinhu kimgevuza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yolema kumtegeleza tatake na mamake.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yokwesa kumgwazo dibwe dilagusa imbaka na miyage.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yomulongoza msuwameso mnzila imwagiza.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yohindula ihaki kwa kumonela munhu baki hebu mwana mkiwa hebu mgane.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe mbigalo yoyose yomuwasa mtwanzi wa tatake, kwavija komgela kinyala tatake.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yomuwasa mnyama yoyose.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yomuwasa lumbu jake yawe mndele wa tatake hebu mndele wa mamake.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yomuwasa mama mkwe yake.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yomkoma munhu kinyelegezi.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yobokela hongo ili yamkome munhu hatendile dihile.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>“ ‘Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yolema kugagoga malagizo gano.’ Na wanhu wose wedike, ‘Ona!’<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ganogile kwa waja otegeleza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Walawi 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kumbukumbu 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>“Mwahamtegeleza goya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kugagoga goya malagizo gake goniwalagiza lelo, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatenda mukale uchanha mwa wanhu wa isi zose mwiisi yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Mwahamtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, momweda kwa vinhu vingi kamba vino,<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>“Mabuga genu gomweda na imigunda yenu yomweda.<verse eid="DEU 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>“Momweda na mokuwa na wana wengi na mokuwa na ndiya nyingi na ng'ombe wengi na ng'hondolo wengi.<verse eid="DEU 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>“Vigelo venu vomweda na viya venu va kutelekela vomweda.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>“Momweda vimkwingila mng'anda na momweda vimulawa kunze. <verse eid="DEU 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Wanhu owehila wahawavamila, Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda wahumwe mgameso genu. Okwiza kuwavamila kwa nzila imoja, lakini owakimbila kwa nzila saba. <verse eid="DEU 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kogatenda makanho genu gamwede na sang'hano zenu zose. Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatenda mumwede mwiisi iyowagwaa.<verse eid="DEU 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>“Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda muwe wanhu wake wang'alile kamba viyaiduwile kumwenu, kamba mwahagagoga malagizo gake heyo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kukweleleza nzila zake. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Avo wanhu wa isi zose mwiisi yose, wahakona kamba mweye mokemigwa kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu owadumba. <verse eid="DEU 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowagwelela wana wengi na fugo nyingi na ndiya nyingi mna iisi iyaiduwile Mndewa Imulungu kwa wahenga zenu kuwagwaa mweye. <verse eid="DEU 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowavugulila ngama yake kulawa kuulanga, na kowagalila mvula mna umsimu wake, na kowatenda mumwede mzisang'hano zenu zose. Mowakopesha wanhu wa isi nyingi, lakini mweye hamukopa bule. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda mugendelele kuulongozi na siyo kuchugu na mokuwa wa ichanduso na siyo wa ikimambukizo kamba mwahagagoga goya malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu goniwalagiza lelo na mwahagakweleleza, <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>kamba hamuhinduka mna zimbuli ziniwalagiza lelo, na kuchola ukumoso hebu ukudila kuikweleleza imilungu iyagwe na kuisang'hanila.<verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makungu kwa kuleka kutegeleza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Walawi 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>“Lakini kamba hamumtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hebu kamba hamuiteganya na kugagoga malagizo gake gose na mafundizo gake goniwalagiza lelo, avo makungu gano gose gowapata. <verse eid="DEU 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Mabuga genu goduwiligwa na imigunda yenu yoduwiligwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>Vigelo venu voduwiligwa na viya venu va kutelekela voduwiligwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>Moduwiligwa na honda muwe na wana wengi na honda muwe na ndiya nyingi na honda muwe na ng'ombe wengi na honda muwe na ng'hondolo wengi. <verse eid="DEU 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>Moduwiligwa vimkwingila mng'anda na moduwiligwa vimulawa kunze.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>“Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila makungu na mikubulo na magayo kwa kila kinhu kimtenda na hamukawa kunangigwa na kupotela mbuli ya gehile genu kwavija mmuleka Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila mitamu mbaka mose vonda mukomigwe mwiisi imuchola kuisola. <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowatowa kwa kifuwa kikulu na mihoma na milulumu mulukuli na vuke kali na zuwa kali na mikukuzumbi na kungugu, avo vose vowezila mbaka mose mofa. <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Ulanga okuwa wela na isi yokuwa ndala kamba zuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/>Mndewa Imulungu koditenda timbwisi na msanga viwe mvula yenu, timbwisi dowapwililikila mbaka mofa.<verse eid="DEU 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>“Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda muhumwe na iwanhu owehila, mowagendela kwa nzila imoja lakini mowakimbila kwa nzila saba, na wanhu wose wali mwiisi odumba vonda wagone ago gawapatile mweye. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Mwahafa ng'huli zenu zokuwa ndiya ya ndege na ndiya ya ming'onyo ya kumuhulo na kuduhu munhu yonda yawawinge. <verse eid="DEU 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila mapute gawapatile Wamisili, na mokuwa na milonda na vibuhu moizega lakini hamuhonyigwa bule. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda muwe vichala na wasuwameso na wazimu. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Imisi mogenda kwa kubabasa babasa kamba munhu halola viyogenda mdiziza na hamumweda bule kwa chochose kimsang'hana. Mobunzigwa na kubokigwa na kokuwa kuduhu munhu wa kuwataza.<verse eid="DEU 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>“Mowalavila vilama watwanzi lakini wanhu wayagwe owawasa. Mozenga ng'anda lakini wanhu wayagwe awo onda wakale. Mohanda mizabibu lakini hamugaja bule matunda gake. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Ng'ombe zenu ochinjigwa mgameso genu, lakini hamulanza bule inyama, vihongwe wenu osoligwa mgameso genu na hawabwezigwa bule. Ng'hondolo zenu ogweleligwa iwanhu owehila, na kuduhu munhu yonda yawataze. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Wanenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi ogweleligwa wanhu wayagwe kuno molola, imisi yose mobunhula meso mobeta wabwele, lakini mokuwa mwabule cha kutenda.<verse eid="DEU 28:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>“Wanhu hamuwajuwile osola ndiya yenu imuisang'hanile kwa nguvu nyingi na hamukwambulila kinhu, lakini mokoneligwa na kugazigwa siku zenu zose, <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>mbaka mopata lukwale kwa gaja gonda mone kwa meso genu wenyego. <verse eid="DEU 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowatowa kwa kuwagalila mipute mmavindi na mmagulu na hamuhonyigwa bule, gokwenela kulawa mzinyayo mbaka mmapala.<verse eid="DEU 28:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>“Mndewa Imulungu kowagala mweye na mndewa wenu imumsagule, mwiisi mweye hamuijuwile bule hebu iwahenga zenu na kuko moisang'hanila imilungu iyagwe ya mibiki na mibwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>Na mweye mokuwa kinhu kigevuza na lusimo na kilozo hagati ya iwanhu wose wa isi yonda mugaligwe na Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 28:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Mohanda mbeyu nyingi mmigunda yenu lakini mosenga kidogo, kwavija nzige ovija vimuhandile. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Mohanda mizabibu na kuidahulila, lakini hamubawa bule gamatunda gake wala kuing'wa divai yake, kwavija wang'onyo woija. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Mokuwa na mizeituni mwiisi yenu yose, lakini mokuwa mduhu mavuta ga kubakala, kwavija zeituni zolagala hasi. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Molela wana wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi lakini honda wawe wenu bule, kwavija wanhu owaboka na kukala nao. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Mibiki yenu ya matunda na ndiya yenu mmigunda vosoligwa na nzige.<verse eid="DEU 28:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>“Iwanhu baki iwokala mwiisi yenu okuwa wa ichanduso na mweye mokuwa wa ikimambukizo. <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>Hewo owakopesha mweye, lakini mweye hamudaha kuwakopesha. Hewo ogendelela kuulongozi na mweye mokuwa kuchugu.<verse eid="DEU 28:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>“Makungu gano gose gowapata mweye na gowakweleleza mbaka gawakome, kwavija hamumtegeleze Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kugagoga malagizo gake gose na mafundizo gayawagwelele. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Avo vose vokuwa vilaguso na unzonza kumwenu na ulelo wenu wose siku zose.<verse eid="DEU 28:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>“Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kawatenda mumwede kwa kila kinhu, lakini hamumsang'hanile kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa kudeng'helela. <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>Avo, mowasang'hanila iwanhu owehila onda wagaligwe kumwenu na Mndewa Imulungu kuno mna nzala na ng'hilu na mwa mwazi na mwabule kinhu chochose. Mndewa Imulungu kowafunga nila ya zuma mbaka yawakome.<verse eid="DEU 28:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>“Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila wanhu wa isi iyagwe kulawa kutali, owavamila kwa nguvu kamba mhungu viyovamila, wanhu wa isi ayo mweye hamuujuwile ulonzi wao. <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>Wanhu wa isi ayo wana vihanga va usede, hawamtegeleza mvele hebu kumonela bazi mbwanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>Woja ng'ombe wenu na ndiya yenu, mbaka vonda mufe wose. Hawawalekela ndiya hebu divai hebu mavuta hebu ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo mbaka vonda mufe wose. <verse eid="DEU 28:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>Wanhu awo ogazunguluka mabuga genu gose, mbaka senyenge zenu nhali zizunguluswe zimutamanile, zobomoligwa hasi kila hanhu mwiisi yenu iyawagwelele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 28:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>“Kipindi wanhu owehila vonda wawazunguluke na kuwadununza, mowaja wanenu wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi waja wamugweleligwe na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Hata munhu ija imuhole na yaleligwe vinogile komnyima ndiya ndugu yake na mwehe wake yomnogela na mwanage yonda yasigale, <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>na hamgwelela hata munhu inyama ya wanage onda yawaje. Honda musigale na kinhu chochose mmabuga genu gose kipindi acho cha kuzungulukigwa na kugazigwa na iwanhu owehila. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Hata mtwanzi ija yeli muhole na yaleligwe vinogile na yanogile na hanawahi kukanyaga isi kwa lwayo lwake, komnyima mbigalo wake yamnogelaga na wanage, <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>na kokija iking'hele chonda yalele na isambo yonda ilawe bila mbigalo wake hebu mwanage kujuwa. Kinhu acho cholawilila kipindi acho cha kuzungulukigwa mabuga genu na iwanhu owehila na kugazigwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>“Kamba hamzigoga goya mbuli zose za malagizo gano gandikigwe mna ikitabu kino, na kamba hamdidumba ditwaga dikulu na da kudumbiza da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/>avo Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila mweye na ulelo wenu magayo hagahungukaga na usungu na mitamu haihonaga. <verse eid="DEU 28:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>Kowagalila kabili mitamu yose yumudumbile akuja Misili, mitamu ayo yowakweleleza siku zose. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/>Vivija Mndewa Imulungu kowagalila kila utamu na magayo gayagwe hagatambuligwe mna ikitabu kino cha malagizo mbaka mukomigwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>Hamoja mweye mwa wengi kamba nhondo zili kuulanga, lakini mosigala kidogo, kwavija hamumtegeleze bule Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>Kamba vija Mndewa Imulungu viyonogelwa kuwatendela ganogile na kuwatenda mongezeke, vivo Mndewa Imulungu viyonogelwa kuwahonda na kuwabananga. Na mweye mosegesigwa mwiisi ayo yumuchola kuisola.<verse eid="DEU 28:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>“Avo Mndewa Imulungu kowapwililisa mziisi zose, kulawa mwambu uno wa isi mbaka mwambu uyagwe na kuko moitambikila imilungu iyagwe ya mibiki na mibwe, imilungu ayo hamuijuwile mweye hebu iwahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>Mna ziisi azo haduhu hanhu ha kubwihila, haduhu hanhu ha kwika mgulu ili ubwihile, lakini Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda munyawenyawe na kowasegesela tamanilo na kowagwaa magayo ga mmizoyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Siku zenu zose mokala kwa kunyawanyawa, imisi na ikilo mokala kwa kudumba mbuli ya ugima wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Mizoyo yenu yomema bwembwe da kila kinhu kimona. Imitondo molonga, ‘Maza iwege ichungulo,’ na ichungulo yahavika molonga, ‘Maza iwege imitondo.’ <verse eid="DEU 28:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowabweza Misili kwa meli, ako kuyalongile honda mubwele ng'o. Kuko moichuuza kwa wanhu owehila kamba watumwa wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi, lakini kuduhu munhu yonda yawagule.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s">Lagano da Mndewa Imulungu mwiisi ya Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>Zino azo mbuli za lagano da Mndewa Imulungu diyamulagize Musa yaditende kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli mwiisi ya Moabu, wahaleka lagano diyatendile Mndewa Imulungu ako kulugongo lwa Holebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Musa kawakema Waizilaeli wose kawalongela, “Mugona kwa meso genu wenyego gaja Mndewa Imulungu gayamtendele Falao, imndewa wa Misili, na iwasang'hanaji zake wose na isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>Kwa meso genu mugona magazo makulu na vilaguso na unzonza mkulu. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>Lakini mbaka lelo Mndewa Imulungu hanawagwelela mizoyo ya kujuwa, na meso ga kulola na magwiti ga kuhulika.<verse eid="DEU 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>“Kwa kipindi cha miyaka malongo mane niwalongoza kuluwala, viwalo venu havilalile, na vilatu venu havilalile mmagulu genu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Hamudile magate hebu kung'wa divai hebu kung'wa ugimbi. Nitenda vivo ili mujuwe kamba niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>“Vimuvikile hanhu hano, Sihoni mndewa wa Heshiboni na Ogu mndewa wa Bashani weza kuitowa na siye, lakini tuwahuma, <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>tuisola isi yao na tuwagwelela isi ayo kamba uhazi wao wanhu wa makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi na nusu ya kabila da Manase. <verse eid="DEU 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Avo zigogeni mbuli zose zilongigwe mdilagano dino na mutende kamba vizilonga ili mumwede mna ikila kinhu kimutenda.<verse eid="DEU 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>“Lelo mweye mose mwima kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, vilongozi wenu wa makabila na iwavele wenu na iwakulu zenu na wambigalo wose wa Waizilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>wanenu na wehe zenu na iwanhu baki iwokala mzing'hambi zenu, awo owakanhilaga zingodi na kuwadehela mazi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>Mwima hano ili mwingile mdilagano da kuiduwila da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu doyotenda lelo na mweye, <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>ili yawatogole mweye kamba wanhu zake, na heyo yawe Imulungu wenu kamba viyaiduwile kwa iwahenga zenu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>Sikwika lagano dino da kuiduwila mbuli yenu mweye mwiiyeka, <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>lakini vivija kwa munhu yoyose yemile hano na siye kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, na kwa awo Waizilaeli hawanavumbuka.<verse eid="DEU 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>“Mujuwa vitukalile mwiisi ya Misili na vitubitile mziisi za wanhu wayagwe mbaka tuvika hano. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Muvona vinhu vao vigevuza, vinyago vao va mibiki na mibwe na shaba na zahabu vikalile hagati yao. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Muiteganye sikukuwe na munhu yoyose hagati yenu, mbigalo hebu mtwanzi hebu lukolo hebu kabila mna imweye mwimile hano yonda yamuleke Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu na kuisang'hanila imilungu ya isi azo. Awo okuwa kamba mzizi hagati yenu ulela matunda geli na sumu na gausungu. <verse eid="DEU 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Sikukuwe na munhu yoyose hagati yenu yahahulika mbuli za lagano dino dimuiduwile, abaho kogelegeza muumoyo wake na kulonga, ‘Nokala goya, hata kamba nokweleleza nzila zangu mwenyego.’ Mbuli ayo yowananga wose, wanogile na wehile. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu hazigela kumgongo nzambi za munhu ayo, na ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu na migongo yake vomsakaza munhu ayo. Makungu gose gandikigwe mna ikitabu kino gompata, na Mndewa Imulungu kodisegesa twaga da munhu ayo hasi ya ulanga. <verse eid="DEU 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/>Mndewa Imulungu kombagula munhu ayo kulawa mna gamakabila gose ga Waizilaeli na komgalila makungu gose ga lagano gandikigwe mna ikitabu kino cha malagizo.<verse eid="DEU 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>“Mna uulelo wenu ako kumwande na wanhu baki okala isi ya kutali, ogona magayo na mikubulo yonda yaigale Mndewa Imulungu mwiisi ino. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>Isi yose yomema mabwe gokwaka na mkele, kuduhu kinhu kihandigwa hebu kikota, hata misanze hoyota bule. Yokuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyagabanange mabuga ga Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu aho viyagevuzike. <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>Wanhu wa isi zose olonga, ‘Habali Mndewa Imulungu kaitenda vino isi ino? Habali kagevuzika kamba vino?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>Na wanhu okwidika vino, ‘Kwavija walema kudigoga lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa wahenga zao, diyaditendile na hewo viyawalavile mwiisi ya Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>na wachola waisang'hanila na kuitambikila milungu iyagwe, imilungu hawaijuwile na hawagweleligwe. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Avo ng'hasiliki ya Mndewa Imulungu yoisoma isi ino na kugala makungu gose gandikigwe mna ikitabu kino, <verse eid="DEU 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>avo, Mndewa Imulungu kawang'ola kulawa mwiisi yao kwa ng'hasiliki na kugevuzika na kawasa mna iisi iyagwe, kamba viikoneka lelo.’<verse eid="DEU 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29"/>“Gaja ga ikinyelegezi gake Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu, lakini gayatugubulile, getu siye na wanetu ili siku zose, tutende mbuli zose za malagizo gano.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s">Ganogile vonda mumbwelele Mndewa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>Musa kagendelela kulonga, “Ago gose gahawapata, ukumweda na makungu, ganiwekileni kuulongozi wenu, na mwahagakumbuka mmizoyo yenu mna iziisi azo zonda yawapwililisile Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>na mombwelela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, mweye na wanenu, na kugoga gose ganiwalagize lelo kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose, <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>baho Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowabwezela gaja gose ganogile na kowonela bazi na koweka hamoja kulawa mziisi zose ziyawapwililisile. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Na hata kamba mupwililika mna ziisi za kutali, Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, koweka hamoja na kowabweza. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowagala mna iisi iwaisolile iwahenga zenu, na mweye moisola isi ayo, na kowatendela ganogile ng'hani na mokuwa wanhu wengi ng'hani kubanza iwahenga zenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu koikosha mizoyo yenu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania olonga, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu koingiza kumbi mizoyo yenu.</char></note> na mizoyo ya ulelo wenu, ili mumnogele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose avo muwe wagima. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowakutulila makungu gano gose iwanhu owehila, awo wawadununze. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Na mweye momtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu na kugoga malagizo gake gose goniwalagiza lelo. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kowatendela ganogile mna ikila kinhu kimtenda, mokuwa na wana wengi na ng'ombe wengi na migunda yenu yolela ndiya nyingi. Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu konogelwa kabili kuwatendela ganogile kamba viyanogelwe kuwatendela ganogile iwahenga zenu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>kamba mwahamtegeleza Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu na kugoga malagizo na mafundizo gandikigwe mna ikitabu cha malagizo na kumbwelela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kwa mizoyo yenu yose na kwa loho zenu zose.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusagula ugima hebu ifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>“Malagizo goniwagwaa lelo si madala bule kumwenu, na hageli kutali na mweye. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>Hagali kuulanga mbaka mulonge, ‘Nani yonda yakwele kuulanga yatugalile ili tugategeleze na tugagoge?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>Vivija hagali umwambu wa bahali mbaka mulonge, ‘Nani yonda yaloke ibahali yatugalile ili tugategeleze na tugagoge?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Aka, imbuli ya behi yenu, ya mmilomo yenu na mmizoyo yenu ili muigoge.<verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>“Loleni lelo niwekila kuulongozi wenu, ugima na ganogile, ifa na gehile. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>Kamba mwahagagoga malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, goniwalagiza lelo, kwa kumnogela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kwa kukweleleza nzila zake na kugoga malagizo gake na mafundizo gake na gaja golondigwa, avo mokuwa wagima na mokongezeka na Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowatendela ganogile mwiisi imukwingila kuisola. <verse eid="DEU 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Lakini mwahahinduka na kulema kumtegeleza, na mwahakwegigwa kuitambikila imilungu iyagwe na kuisang'hanila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>niye nowalongela lelo kamba mokomigwa. Honda mukale kwa siku nyingi mna iisi yumuchola kuisola, umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Lelo noukema ulanga na isi viwalole mweye, kamba niwekila kuulongozi wenu ugima na ifa, kumweda na makungu. Avo saguleni ugima, mweye na ulelo wenu ili mukale wagima, <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>mumnogele Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na mumtegeleze na mumgoge heyo. Kwavija heyo ayo ugima wenu na heyo ayo yowagwaa siku nyingi za kukala wagima, ili mukale mwiisi Mndewa Imulungu iyaiduwile kuwagwaa iwahenga zenu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kosola hanhu ha Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Kupetigwa 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Avo, Musa kagendelela kulonga na Waizilaeli wose, <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>kawalongela, “Niye sambi nina miyaka gana na malongo mabili, na sidaha bule kuwalongoza. Na Mndewa Imulungu kanongela kamba siloka umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kowalongolela na kowakoma iwanhu wa isi zili kuko, ili muisole isi yao, na Yoshua kokuwa kilongozi wenu kamba viyalongile Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowabananga iwanhu wa isi azo kamba viyawabanage Sihoni na Ogu, iwandewa wa Waamoli na isi yao. <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowatenda muwahume na mweye muwatendele kamba viniwalagize. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Mugangamale na muwe magalu, sikumuwadumbe hebu kunyawanyawa, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu kochola hamoja na mweye. Heyo hawaleka bule hebu kuwasemwa.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Abaho Musa kamkema Yoshua, kamulongela mgameso ga iwanhu wose wa Izilaeli, “Ugangamale na uwe galu, kwavija gweye kowalongoza iwanhu mwiisi iyaiduwile Mndewa Imulungu kwa iwahenga wao kuwagwaa hewo, na gweye uwatende waisole. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo yowalongoza, heyo kokuwa hamoja na mweye, heyo hawaleka bule hebu kuwasemwa. Avo sikumudumbe hebu kunyawanyawa.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusomigwa kwa malagizo kila mwaka wa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Avo, Musa kandika malagizo gago, kawagwelela iwalava nhosa wa ulelo wa Lawi, awo wakalile odipapa disanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, na iwavele wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Abaho Musa kawalagiza kalonga, “Kila mwaka wa saba okuwa mwaka wa kulekeswa. Mna inyimwilinyimwili ya vibanda ya mwaka awo, <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>Waizilaeli wose wahaiting'hane kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, hanhu aho honda yahasagule, muwasomele malagizo gano iwanhu wose. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Wating'hanizeni iwanhu wose, iwambigalo na iwatwanzi na iwana na iwanhu baki iwokala mna gamabuga genu, ili kila munhu yategeleze na yaifunze kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na yagagoge goya malagizo gano gose. <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>Na awo iwanenu hawagajuwile, wagahulike na waifunze kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kipindi chose vonda mukale mwiisi imuchola kuisola ako umwambu wa Yolidani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga Imulungu kwa Musa na Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>Avo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Siku yako ya kufa yammabehi kuvika. Mkeme Yoshua mwize wose mna dihema da mting'hano ili nimgwelele malagizo yang'hali hanakuwa kilongozi wenu.” Avo, Musa na Yoshua wengila mna dihema da mting'hano, <verse eid="DEU 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>na Mndewa Imulungu kawalawila mumo mna imhanda ya wingu imile hana ulwivi lwa dihema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Gweye sambi kofa, kochola kwa iwahenga zako. Abaho iwanhu wano osegela na kuikweleleza imilungu iyagwe ya isi iwochola kuisola na ondeka na kubena lagano dinitendile na hewo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Aho ng'hasiliki yangu yowakila na niye nowaleka na kufisa kihanga changu, ili wabanangigwe. Gehile na magazo gowapata na olonga, ‘Gehile gano gatupata kwavija Imulungu wetu heli hagati yetu.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>Ona, nofisa kihanga changu mbuli ya gehile gawatendile na kwavija waihindukila imilungu iyagwe.<verse eid="DEU 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>“Avo, wandike lwila luno, na uwafunze wanhu wa Izilaeli ili uwe usindila wangu kumwao. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>Vonda niwagale mwiisi imemile maziwa na uki, kamba viniiduwile kwa iwahenga zao, na woja na kwiguta na kuneneha, abaho ohindukila imilungu iyagwe na kuisang'hanila. Onibeza na kubena lagano jangu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Wahapata magazo mengi na mikubulo, lwila luno lokuwa kamba usindila kwavija honda usemwigwe na ulelo wao. Vino sambi ning'hali sinawagala mwiisi ayo iniiduwile kuwagwaa, nojuwa gaja gowogesa kusang'hana.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Avo, Musa kandika lwila ulo siku didija, na kawafunza Waizilaeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulagiza Yoshua, mwanage Nuni, kamulongela, “Ugangamale na uwe galu, kwavija kowagala Waizilaeli mwiisi iniiduwile kuwagwaa, na niye nokuwa hamoja na gweye.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Musa viyamambukize kwandika mbuli za malagizo gago kulawa mwanduso mbaka kuuhelelo, <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>kawalagiza Iwalawi wakalile odipapa disanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>“Soleni kitabu kino cha malagizo, mukike kumgwazo wa disanduku da lagano da Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, kikale baho kamba usindila kumwenu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>Kwavija nojuwa mweye vimwili wadulu na hamutogolaga kutegeleza. Kamba mmulema Mndewa Imulungu vivino vinili mgima avo mobanza ng'hani kumulema vonda nife! <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Wating'hanize kuulongozi wangu iwavele wose wa makabila genu na ivilongozi wenu ili nilonge mbuli zino kuno otegeleza, na noukema ulanga na isi viwalole ili viwe usindila kumwao. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>Kwavija nojuwa vonda nife motenda gehile na kuileka nzila iniwalagize muikweleleze. Avo, mzisiku azo mopata mikubulo kwavija motenda gehile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu na momgevuza kwa ago gomsang'hana.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwila lwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Abaho Musa kazibwelela mbuli zose za lwila ulo mna gamagwiti ga Waizilaeli wose waiting'hane.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>“Tegeleza gweye ulanga, gano gonilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">tegeleza gweye isi, mbuli za mulomo wangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>Mafundizo gangu godwendweka kamba mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">mbuli zangu zolagala kamba kungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">kamba mawaga mna iminoga mideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">kamba mvula mna gamajani mabisi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>Nodisimulila twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">na mweye mulonge, ‘Imulungu wetu Mkulu!’<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo Dibwe kulu da kuifisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">nzila zake za haki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Imulungu yotamaniligwa na yelibule kitala chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">heyo kotenda kwa haki na katelela.<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>Lakini mweye mswela kutamaniligwa kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mweye siyo wanage mbuli ya nzambi zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mweye mwa ulelo wihile na upotele.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>Vino habali momuliha Mndewa Imulungu kamba avo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mweye wanhu wabozi na mulibule nzewele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Vino heyo siyo tataenu yawalumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">kawatenda na kuwasimika?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>Kumbukeni siku za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">gelegezeni miyaka mingi ibitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wauzeni iwahenga zenu, owalagusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wauzeni iwavele wenu, owalongela mbuli za umwaka.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>Ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani viyawagwelele wanhu wa isi uhazi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">viyawagolile iwanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">kila wanhu na isi yao na kawekila imbaka yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">kamba viweli iwana wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kaweka wanhu wa Yakobo wawe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">awo kawasagula wawe uhazi wake.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>Kawona Waizilaeli owegela kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">ako kuna dibeho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Kawakaliza na kawalola goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">kawalela kamba munhu viyokaliza imwana wa siso jake.<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>Kamba mhungu yokaliza kisanza chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kozumha zumha uchanha ya makinda gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na koganzanza mabawa gake ili yawagoge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kowapapa mna gamabawa gake.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Mndewa Imulungu mwenyego kawalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">na kuduhu imulungu iyagwe yawatazile.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>Kawabitiza kuvigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na waja ndiya yotile mmigunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Kawagwaa uki kulawa mzimhango za mibwe waje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mizeituni yotile kulawa mdibwe dala.<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>Kawagwaa mtindi na maziwa ga ng'ombe na mbuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">mavuta ga ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ng'hondolo mbigalo na mbuzi wa Bashani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Kawagwaa ngano inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">na divai ya sambi wang'we.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>Wanhu wa Izilaeli waneneha na wavitowa mateke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">waneneha na wakala na vitambi na wagilimbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">abaho wamuleka Imulungu yawalumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wambeza Dibwe kulu imkombola wao.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Wamtenda yakone migongo kwa imilungu yao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">na kwa vinhu vigevuza wamtenda yagevuzike.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>Wavilavila nhosa vinyamkela weli siyo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">waicholela imilungu hawaijuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">imilungu izile sambi sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">ayo haitegelezigwe na iwahenga zao.<verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Mmuleka Dibwe yawagwelele ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">mumsemwa Imulungu yeli chanduso cha ugima wenu.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>Mndewa Imulungu kayona mbuli ayo na kawaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">kagevuzigwa na wanage wa ikimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>Kalonga, ‘Nokifisa kihanga changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">ndole kimambukizo chao chokuwaze,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">kwavija awo ulelo wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">na wana hawatamaniligwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>Wanitenda nyone migongo kwa kinhu hakili imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">wanigevuza kwa vinyago vao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Avo nowatenda wone migongo mbuli ya iwanhu okoneka siyo wanhu goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">na nowagevuza kubitila wanhu wa isi ya wabozi.<verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Ng'hasiliki yangu yokwaka moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yosoma mbaka hasi kowochola wanhu wafile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yosakaza isi yose na vose vili mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yolukuza migimbo ya vigongo.<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>‘Nowagalila magayo hogomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">nomambukiza misale yangu kumwao.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>Osoka kwa nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na wofa kwa mitamu na mikubulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Nowagalila ming'onyo mikali iwalumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na mizoka itambala ili na sumu.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Ng'hondo yogala ifa kudibuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na mzing'anda wanhu okuwa na bwembwe ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">wabwanga na wandele okomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">hata ving'hele na wavele weli na uhenga.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>Nahawabanange wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">na kutenda sikuwakumbukigwe kabili na munhu yoyose,<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>ila nidumba kuitapa kwa awo owehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">ili awo owehila sikuwagese kamba wawabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">na niye Mndewa Imulungu sitendile kinhu!’<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Wanhu wa isi ya Izilaeli awo wanhu welibule nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">na iwanhu hawagelegeza goya.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Maza wakalile na nzewele wahajuwile habali wahumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">na wahajuwile kimambukizo chao chokuwa vilihi.<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Munhu imoja kodaha vilihi kuwahuma wanhu elufu imoja</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">hebu wanhu wabili odaha vilihi kuwahuma wanhu elufu kumi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Yodahika kamba Dibwe jao kulu kawaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na Mndewa Imulungu wao mkulu kawadonha.<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Hata iwanhu otwihila ojuwa kamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">Dibwe jao siyo kamba Dibwe jetu.<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>Kwavija mizabibu yao yolawa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">ilawa mmigunda ya Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">zabibu zake zina sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">vimvaba vake va usungu.<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>Divai yao kamba sumu ya nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:33">ina sumu kali kamba ya muyombo.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>Vino, gano sigekile goya kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">na kugeka mkihenge changu?<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>Niye ayo yonda nilihe gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">niye nowaliha gehile mna ikipindi vonda walemelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kwavija siku da kubanangigwa kwao divika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">na kimambukizo chao cha mmabehi.<verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowagombela wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kowonela bazi iwasang'hanaji zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">yahakona nguvu zao zimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuduhu yasigale, mfungwa hebu yalekesigwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kowauza wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Yakwahi ayo imilungu yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">dibwe dimucholile kuifisa kumwake?’<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>Yakwahi ayo imilungu idile sadaka zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na kung'wa divai na nhosa zenu za kung'wa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Avo lekeni inuke iwataze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">lekeni iwahonye!<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>‘Loleni kamba niye ayo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na kuduhu iyagwe ila niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Niye nokoma na nokwika ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">nolumiza na kuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">kuduhu yodaha kumuhonya yoyose mmakono gangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Nogolosa mkono wangu kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">na noiduwila kamba vinili mgima milele,<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>mwahajona sime jangu dimelemeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na nogolosa mkono kutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nowaliha gehile awo onilema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na nowakoboza awo onihila.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>Misale yangu yokoligwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">sime jangu dokwiguta nyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">sime jangu dododa kwa damu ya vilonda va wafungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na awo onihila weli na mvili nhali.’<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>Mweye wanhu wa isi ziyagwe, wadeng'heleleni wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kwavija heyo koliha kwa damu ya wasang'hanaji zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kowaliha awo omulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na koisunha isi ya wanhu zake.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Musa na Yoshua, mwanage Nuni, weza kuulongozi wa iwanhu, Musa kazibwelela mbuli za lwila uno, avo Waizilaeli wose wauhulike. <verse eid="DEU 32:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Musa viyamambukize kuwalongela wanhu wa Izilaeli mbuli zino zose, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>kawalongela, “Zikeni mmizoyo yenu mbuli zose ziniwagwelele lelo. Molondigwa muwalongele wanenu ili wazigoge kwa kutamaniligwa mbuli zose za malagizo gano. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Kwavija malagizo gano siyo mbuli ziiyeka ila ago ugima wenu, kubitila malagizo gano mokala siku nyingi mwiisi yumuchola kuisola, mwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Musa yolongigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>Siku didijo Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>“Kwela kulugongo luno lwa Abalimu, lugongo lwa Nebo mwiisi ya Moabu, mwambu kwa mwambu na buga da Yeliko, uilole isi ya Kanaani iniwagwelela Waizilaeli iwe yao. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>Abaho kuko kulugongo kofa na koiting'hana na wahenga zako wafile mwaka kamba viyafile mkulu wako Haluni kulugongo lwa Holi na kaiting'hana na wahenga zake, <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>kwavija mweye wabili mubena lagizo jangu mgameso ga Waizilaeli. Vimukalile ako kugamazi ga Meliba behi na buga da Kadeshi kuna uluwala lwa Sini, hamungwelele ukulu mgameso ga iwanhu. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Avo koyona isi kwa kutali, lakini honda wingile bule mna iisi iniwagwelela wanhu wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s">Musa kogatambikila makabila ga Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Zino azo mbuli za kutambikila ziyalongile Musa, munhu wa Imulungu, kawalongela wanhu wa Izilaeli yang'hali hanakufa.<verse eid="DEU 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>“Mndewa Imulungu keza kulawa kulugongo lwa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">katulawila kulawa kulugongo lwa Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">katumwemwesela kulawa kulugongo lwa Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Kalawa hagati ya wasenga elufu kumi wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na moto ukwaka mumkono wake wa ukudila.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawanogela wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kowakaliza wanhu zake wang'alile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Avo wakweleleza lwayo lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na wagoga gayawalongele.<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>Musa katulagiza tugagoge malagizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">mbuli ino ayo ngama yetu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawa Mndewa wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">kipindi vilongozi wao viwaiting'hane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">na makabila gose vigaiting'hane.”<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>Musa kalonga mbuli ya kabila da Lubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Lubeni yawe mgima na wala sikuyafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">hamoja wanhu wake okuwa wadodo.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Kwa kabila da Yuda kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Go Mndewa Imulungu utegeleze kililo cha kabila da Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">umbweze kabili kwa ndugu zake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Mgombele kwa makono gako mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uditaze kabila da Yuda mbuli ya awo omwihila.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Kwa kabila da Lawi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Go Mndewa Imulungu uwalongele wanhu wa kabila da Lawi gaja goulonda kwa mabwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania gago gamabwe gokemigwa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ulimu na Tumimu.</char></note> ga kujuwa gaja goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">awo wauwagezile ako Masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">na kugomba nao ako Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>Walawi wawaleka tata zao na mama zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">wawasemwa ndugu zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">hawawajuwile hata wanao kwavija wagagoga malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na wagoga lagano jako.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>Na owafunza wana wa Yakobo mafundizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">owafunza wanhu wa Izilaeli malagizo gako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Walawi osoma ubani mgameso gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">na nhosa za kusoma moto uchanha ya upango wako wa nhosa.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu uwatende wamwede kwa nguvu zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">utogole sang'hano za makono gao, ubene nguvu za awo owehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">na uwatende sikuwenuke kabili.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Kwa kabila da Benjamini kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Dino dijo kabila diyodinogela Mndewa Imulungu na kodikaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">kowakaliza imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">na kokala mvigongo vake.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Kwa kabila da Yusufu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Mndewa Imulungu na yaitende imwede isi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">yaitende imwede kwa mvula kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na mbwibwi kulawa hasi ya isi,<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>yaitende imwede kwa matunda gepile goya kwa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">matunda goleligwa kila msimu,<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>kwa ndiya inogile na ndiya nyingi ya vigongo va umwaka.<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>Isi yake imeme ganogile gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">imwede kwa ganogile golawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">yalawile mkisolo kikwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Kumweda kuko kuwavikile wanhu wa kabila da Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">yakalile mkulu hagati ya ndugu zake.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Ukulu wake kamba ukulu wa ng'ombe mbigalo wa ichanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">mhembe zake kamba mhembe za nyati mbigalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Kozitumia kuwasung'ha wanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">kowasung'ha mbaka kuuhelelo wa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Efulaimu kokuwa na wakalizi wa ng'hondo maelufu mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na Manase kokuwa na wakalizi wa ng'hondo maelufu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Kwa kabila da Zabuloni na kabila da Isakali kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Zabuloni deng'helela mmwanza wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na gweye Isakali deng'helela mvibanda vako.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Owagoneka wageni mvigongo vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na kuko wanhu olava nhosa zilondigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Kwavija awo opata utajili kulawa mbahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na okuwa na ngama mumsanga wa mwhani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Kwa kabila da Gadi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Yagweleligwe ukulu Imulungu yomgwelela Gadi isi ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi kokala kamba simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">yopalula mkono na pala.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Kosagula isi inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">isi inogile ya kilongozi kekiligwa heyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Wahaiting'hana iwakulu wa iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">heyo kogoga gose goyolonda Mndewa Imulungu kwa kuwatagusa goya Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Kwa kabila da Dani kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani kamba mwana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">yozumha kulawa Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Kwa kabila da Nafutali kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Nafutali kumema bazi dilawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">kumema ganogile golawa kwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">isi yako ya kusini na kudihongela zuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Kwa kabila da Asheli kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Asheli yamwede kubanza wana wose wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">ndugu zako wose wakunogele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na yavabike mgulu wake mna gamavuta ga mizeituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Mabuga gako gakalizigwe kwa nyivi za mizuma na shaba ya kiguzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">na siku zose ugangamale!”<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>Gweye Izilaeli haduhu kamba Imulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">heyo kabita kuulanga keza kukutaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">kabita uchanha kuna uukulu wake.<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Imulungu wa milele heyo wakumkimbilila mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">kawapapa mmakono gake milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Kawawinga wanhu owehila mgameso genu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">kawalagiza, “Wabanangeni.”<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Avo wanhu wa Izilaeli wakala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">wanage Yakobo waiyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mna iisi imemile ndiya na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">na ulanga wake olagaza kungugu.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Mmweda mweye Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Nani kamba mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">mweye mukomboligwe na Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">heyo yeli ngao yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na sime diwatenda muhume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Wanhu owehila okwiza kuno onyawanyawa mgameso genu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na mweye mowabojoga.<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Avo, Musa kasegela aho kudibawe da Moabu, kachola kulugongo lwa Nebo, kakwela kuinhembeti ya Pisiga ili mwambu kwa mwambu na buga da Yeliko. Aho Mndewa Imulungu kamulagusila isi yose kulawa Gileadi mbaka Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>na isi yose ya Nafutali na isi ya Efulaimu na ya Manase na isi yose ya Yuda mbaka ibahali ya Meditelania, <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>na isi ya Negebu, na luwala lwa bonde da Yeliko, dibuga da mitende mbaka Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Musa, “Ino ayo isi iniiduwile kwa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo kamba nowagwaa ulelo wao. Nikulagusila uilole kwa meso gako mwenyego, lakini huvika bule kuko.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Avo, Musa msang'hanaji wa Mndewa Imulungu kafa kuko Moabu, kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyalongile. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamzika kubonde da Moabu, mwambu kwa mwambu na buga da Beti Peoli, lakini mbaka lelo, haduhu munhu yajuwile hanhu kuyazikiligwe. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Musa viyafile kakala na miyaka gana dimoja na malongo mabili, meso gake gakala magima na kakala na nguvu mulukuli. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Waizilaeli wamtendela Musa tanga kwa siku malongo madatu kuna dibawe da Moabu. Abaho siku za matanga gake zisha.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Yoshua mwanage Nuni kamema loho ya nzewele, kwavija Musa kakala yamwikile makono gake. Avo Waizilaeli wamtegeleza Yoshua na kugoga gaja gayagweleligwe Musa na Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Hanalawilila mtula ndagu iyagwe hagati ya iwanhu wa Izilaeli kamba Musa, ayo Mndewa Imulungu yalongile nayo meso kwa meso. <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/>Haduhu mtula ndagu iyagwe yatendile vilaguso na unzonza kamba uja Mndewa Imulungu uyamtumile Musa yautende mgameso ga Falao mndewa wa Misili, na iwakulu wake na isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Haduhu mtula ndagu iyagwe yatendile vinhu vikulu na vigela bwembwe kamba viyatendile Musa mgameso ga Waizilaeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
